WEBVTT

﻿1

00:01:33.369 --> 00:01:34.370
Will you marry me?


00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:35.928
Kabir... please.


00:01:36.439 --> 00:01:37.406
Okay.


00:01:38.207 --> 00:01:39.936
Will you marry me, please?


00:01:41.244 --> 00:01:42.404
Why are you doing this?


00:01:43.145 --> 00:01:45.045
Because sooner or later we will.


00:01:46.315 --> 00:01:47.680
We love each other.


00:01:48.384 --> 00:01:50.682
Our families seem to tolerate each other.


00:01:51.721 --> 00:01:54.690
l'm an architect and
you're an interior designer.


00:01:55.525 --> 00:01:56.549
We're perfect.


00:01:59.862 --> 00:02:00.920
What do you say?


00:02:02.465 --> 00:02:03.489
Are you sure?


00:02:04.233 --> 00:02:06.292
Natasha, please make it quick...


00:02:06.369 --> 00:02:07.097
my knee is hurting.


00:02:09.205 --> 00:02:10.172
Yes!


00:02:28.124 --> 00:02:32.754
lt seems like only yesterday
that Natasha came into this world.


00:02:33.195 --> 00:02:34.526
And today she's getting engaged.


00:02:36.098 --> 00:02:38.123
Kabir, l'm not losing a daughter.


00:02:39.201 --> 00:02:40.725
l'm gaining a son.


00:02:41.304 --> 00:02:42.532
You're so filmy, dad.


00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:47.967
Harryji


00:02:50.146 --> 00:02:53.445
Two years ago you commissioned me
to build your hotel.


00:02:54.417 --> 00:02:57.147
Who would've imagined that
one day we'll be a big family.


00:02:57.620 --> 00:03:00.680
On behalf of my family,
l welcome you all.


00:03:01.123 --> 00:03:01.987
Thank you so much.


00:03:02.625 --> 00:03:06.026
Did you ever know that you're my hero


00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:10.490
You're everything l wish l could be


00:03:11.767 --> 00:03:14.964
l can fly like an eagle


00:03:15.471 --> 00:03:20.499
Cause you're the wind beneath my wings


00:03:21.811 --> 00:03:27.681
You're the wind beneath my wings


00:03:32.421 --> 00:03:33.547
- That was lovely.


00:03:39.061 --> 00:03:39.929
Hello everyone.


00:03:39.929 --> 00:03:41.089
l am lmran.


00:03:41.864 --> 00:03:43.388
Kabir and l have been friends
since school.


00:03:43.599 --> 00:03:44.827
The three Musketeers!


00:03:45.101 --> 00:03:48.002
That's right, it was the name
uncle had given the three of us.


00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.237
The three Musketeers.


00:03:50.072 --> 00:03:52.308
Unfortunately, the third musketeer...


00:03:52.308 --> 00:03:54.503
Arjun is not with us anymore.


00:03:56.212 --> 00:03:59.204
Don't worry, he's alive.
He just isn't here right now.


00:04:01.384 --> 00:04:02.408
Anyway, Natasha...


00:04:02.685 --> 00:04:05.313
Kabir is one of the nicest guys ever.


00:04:06.455 --> 00:04:08.923
So, if you ever smash his BMW,
don't worry.


00:04:10.226 --> 00:04:11.250
Good excuse to get a new car.


00:04:12.695 --> 00:04:15.163
He's also very intelligent.


00:04:16.632 --> 00:04:18.657
So leave the kid's homework to him.


00:04:19.135 --> 00:04:20.469
You're a true friend, thanks.


00:04:20.469 --> 00:04:21.436
You're welcome, bro.


00:04:22.405 --> 00:04:24.270
He's very large hearted.


00:04:24.907 --> 00:04:26.776
So, don't think twice...


00:04:26.776 --> 00:04:28.403
just buy those diamonds.


00:04:34.884 --> 00:04:36.078
Basically Natasha...


00:04:36.686 --> 00:04:38.711
Kabir is a solid guy.


00:04:39.722 --> 00:04:42.122
Put your hand in his and
walk with him.


00:04:43.359 --> 00:04:44.849
Because no matter what...


00:04:45.094 --> 00:04:46.220
he will never let you down.


00:04:47.196 --> 00:04:48.686
- So sweet.
- Hear, hear!


00:04:51.233 --> 00:04:52.200
Thank you.


00:04:52.468 --> 00:04:53.366
You can send the cheque now.


00:04:55.471 --> 00:04:56.165
Tanya...


00:04:57.306 --> 00:04:58.170
thank you.


00:04:59.141 --> 00:05:00.540
Let me warn you...


00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:03.110
Nikhil is planning a
full power bachelor party.


00:05:03.546 --> 00:05:04.413
Too late.


00:05:04.413 --> 00:05:07.109
His school friends have planned
a bachelor holiday.


00:05:07.416 --> 00:05:08.405
A road trip...


00:05:08.617 --> 00:05:09.447
through Spain.


00:05:09.885 --> 00:05:11.750
-A road trip?
- Don't ask.


00:05:12.188 --> 00:05:14.690
They had made some pact
in college that...


00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:17.760
each one would choose
an adventure sport...


00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.785
Are you serious?
Like Fear Factor?.


00:05:20.296 --> 00:05:21.285
Exactly!


00:05:21.363 --> 00:05:23.854
And the other two would have to do it.


00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:25.794
So, what have you picked?


00:05:26.402 --> 00:05:27.767
That l can't say.


00:05:28.938 --> 00:05:30.337
Not in front of me, at least.


00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:32.538
You see...


00:05:32.608 --> 00:05:35.839
the sport we pick
is a surprise for the other two.


00:05:36.312 --> 00:05:37.301
Shut up!


00:05:37.546 --> 00:05:38.911
- Seriously.
- Are you kidding me?


00:05:39.281 --> 00:05:40.270
No.


00:05:40.583 --> 00:05:43.450
That ensures none of us back out.


00:05:44.453 --> 00:05:45.943
Whose idea was this?


00:05:46.455 --> 00:05:47.114
Mine.


00:05:47.857 --> 00:05:48.551
Three weeks.


00:05:48.758 --> 00:05:50.089
You know how these boys are.


00:05:50.626 --> 00:05:51.149
Not Kabir.


00:05:51.961 --> 00:05:53.121
Oh please!


00:05:53.462 --> 00:05:56.022
All guys go crazy at bachelor parties.


00:05:57.133 --> 00:05:58.327
ln fact...


00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:03.133
Nikhil still hasn't told me
what happened at his.


00:06:04.573 --> 00:06:05.437
l don't know.


00:06:06.275 --> 00:06:08.835
l heard something about
your bachelor party.


00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.314
Who told you?


00:06:15.584 --> 00:06:16.551
So it is true.


00:06:17.553 --> 00:06:18.451
Does Natasha know?


00:06:19.455 --> 00:06:20.649
No man, why would l tell her?


00:06:20.956 --> 00:06:22.446
Please... don't tell her.


00:06:24.193 --> 00:06:25.182
She was from Ukraine.


00:06:26.629 --> 00:06:27.960
- Bloody hot!
- Nice.


00:06:28.364 --> 00:06:29.228
l was sloshed.


00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:31.824
Okay, listen...


00:06:32.201 --> 00:06:34.692
lf Sameera finds out about this,
she'll kill me.


00:06:35.271 --> 00:06:36.670
l know, don't worry.


00:06:36.739 --> 00:06:39.909
lt was my last night as a bachelor.
You know l'd never do it otherwise.


00:06:39.909 --> 00:06:41.944
l understand, don't worry about it.


00:06:41.944 --> 00:06:42.933
- Please.
- lt happens.


00:06:44.547 --> 00:06:45.514
Sameera!


00:06:49.018 --> 00:06:50.076
Sorry, l couldn't resist.


00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.785
- Take care, man.
- See you.


00:06:55.758 --> 00:06:58.556
Trust me, this trick never fails.


00:06:59.028 --> 00:07:00.629
What do you mean?


00:07:00.629 --> 00:07:05.157
Well, you tell people you know
something about them...


00:07:05.234 --> 00:07:08.437
and before you know it,
they tell you their secrets.


00:07:08.437 --> 00:07:09.772
Shut up!


00:07:09.772 --> 00:07:11.967
You didn't know about the Ukrainian?


00:07:12.374 --> 00:07:13.739
No, he just told me.


00:07:15.077 --> 00:07:16.738
Mind blowing!


00:07:19.081 --> 00:07:21.914
- Yeah, well time equals money, Simon.
You want money, stop wasting my time.


00:07:22.618 --> 00:07:24.518
Sell 50,000 June contracts!


00:07:24.587 --> 00:07:26.817
50,000 and don't screw up
my stop losses this time!


00:07:28.023 --> 00:07:28.853
How much?


00:07:30.025 --> 00:07:31.390
Damn! That's horrendous!


00:07:32.061 --> 00:07:33.358
Sell it. Sell everything.


00:07:41.036 --> 00:07:43.239
Listen Joe, if you continue to give me
bullshit fills like that...


00:07:43.239 --> 00:07:45.366
l'm going to have to trade
my Ferrari in for a Ford Fiesta!


00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:50.571
We have white and gold and...


00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:52.308
tonnes of champagne.


00:07:52.815 --> 00:07:53.645
And...


00:07:54.717 --> 00:07:55.945
- the centre peice.
- This is nice.


00:07:56.919 --> 00:07:57.817
Finally!


00:07:58.387 --> 00:07:59.081
Kabira!


00:07:59.555 --> 00:08:01.113
Sorry man.


00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:02.919
You have no idea what's happening here.


00:08:03.092 --> 00:08:05.253
And you have no idea
what a nice party you missed.


00:08:06.195 --> 00:08:07.423
l'm sure, man.


00:08:07.897 --> 00:08:08.921
Listen...


00:08:09.398 --> 00:08:10.626
l've a problem.


00:08:11.367 --> 00:08:12.902
l can't make it to Spain.


00:08:12.902 --> 00:08:13.425
- What?!


00:08:14.703 --> 00:08:16.205
Arjun, you promised!


00:08:16.205 --> 00:08:17.973
l know but...


00:08:17.973 --> 00:08:20.999
l thought this deal l'm working on
would come through...


00:08:21.143 --> 00:08:21.802
- but l'm stuck.


00:08:22.411 --> 00:08:25.209
l can't believe you're ditching me
on my bachelor trip.


00:08:26.215 --> 00:08:27.516
lt's not that...


00:08:27.516 --> 00:08:28.881
- Then what is it?


00:08:29.118 --> 00:08:31.609
We had decided to do this together.


00:08:33.389 --> 00:08:35.755
lf you can't make it,
l'm calling it off.


00:08:36.091 --> 00:08:38.321
Don't get sentimental.
lt's my work!


00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:40.095
l'm not.


00:08:40.095 --> 00:08:42.965
lt's been cancelled once before,
so let's do it again.


00:08:42.965 --> 00:08:44.262
lt's fine.


00:08:45.634 --> 00:08:49.092
lt's either the three of us going
or none at all.


00:09:13.195 --> 00:09:14.253
Hey...


00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:15.958
Hi.


00:09:16.198 --> 00:09:16.857
How are you?


00:09:17.366 --> 00:09:18.230
Good.


00:09:19.635 --> 00:09:21.603
Looking good,
you've been working out?


00:09:22.137 --> 00:09:22.694
Yes.


00:09:23.238 --> 00:09:24.728
l usually come in the morning.


00:09:30.045 --> 00:09:31.876
l was going to call you.


00:09:32.781 --> 00:09:33.770
Then why didn't you?


00:09:35.351 --> 00:09:36.716
l'm getting married.


00:09:40.923 --> 00:09:43.448
-That was quick.
- Arjun, please!


00:09:48.364 --> 00:09:49.695
All the best, Rohini.


00:10:07.282 --> 00:10:09.216
- Arjun, it's me again.


00:10:09.718 --> 00:10:11.620
- Don't ditch me.


00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.111
- l know why you're making excuses.


00:10:14.757 --> 00:10:16.759
- But it's been four years
for that incident.


00:10:16.759 --> 00:10:17.748
- l'm getting married now.


00:10:18.761 --> 00:10:20.956
- Even today, l only have two friends.


00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:25.229
- We're the three Musketeers.
All for one, one for all.


00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.998
Have you thought about...


00:10:34.243 --> 00:10:35.267
what we spoke?


00:10:36.078 --> 00:10:36.703
About what?


00:10:38.313 --> 00:10:41.441
Are you moving back to Bombay?


00:10:42.051 --> 00:10:43.040
Ammi...


00:10:43.886 --> 00:10:46.855
l like Delhi and living on my own.


00:10:53.562 --> 00:10:56.465
And this trip to Spain...


00:10:56.465 --> 00:10:59.127
is it a coincidence or
did you plan it?


00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.770
Why don't you just say
what you're really thinking?


00:11:05.274 --> 00:11:06.241
Fine.


00:11:07.409 --> 00:11:09.036
Do you intend to meet Salman?


00:11:10.312 --> 00:11:11.814
l don't know.


00:11:11.814 --> 00:11:13.839
lmran, why don't you trust me?


00:11:14.516 --> 00:11:16.251
lt's not about you Ammi.


00:11:16.251 --> 00:11:18.620
- He is my father.
- He's your father?


00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:23.785
Has he ever called you
or tried to find out how you are?


00:11:23.859 --> 00:11:25.850
Maybe he did and
you kept it from me.


00:11:27.362 --> 00:11:29.728
Until recently l wasn't even aware
that he is my father.


00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:32.124
Alright.


00:11:32.367 --> 00:11:33.869
Do what you want.


00:11:33.869 --> 00:11:36.405
But please remember this.


00:11:36.405 --> 00:11:38.430
Faisal was your only father.


00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.607
- Hello there.
- Hello.


00:11:47.049 --> 00:11:48.383
l can see you.


00:11:48.383 --> 00:11:50.552
l miss you, baby.


00:11:50.552 --> 00:11:53.043
Now we can see each other everyday.


00:11:53.288 --> 00:11:55.756
l'm only going for
three weeks, Natasha.


00:12:04.533 --> 00:12:06.831
What will l do in London all alone?


00:12:07.269 --> 00:12:09.471
You'll shop.


00:12:09.471 --> 00:12:13.669
And in three weeks l'll come to London
to carry your shopping bags.


00:12:13.742 --> 00:12:15.733
- Very funny.
- l know.


00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:00.769
- l don't see Madrid in this plan.
- Because it's not there.


00:16:00.769 --> 00:16:02.634
- We travel to Spain but
we're not going to see the capital?


00:16:02.704 --> 00:16:04.773
- We don't have enough time.


00:16:04.773 --> 00:16:06.468
- We can't change it now.
- l think we should.


00:16:06.541 --> 00:16:07.872
Look who's here!


00:16:09.211 --> 00:16:11.372
- Welcome! How was your flight?
- Hello.


00:16:12.414 --> 00:16:13.648
Well...


00:16:13.648 --> 00:16:14.842
it flew.


00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:16.444
Funny!


00:16:25.026 --> 00:16:27.596
- Good to see you.
- You too.


00:16:27.596 --> 00:16:28.654
l'm sorry about Abu.


00:16:29.531 --> 00:16:31.158
l got your email.


00:16:32.267 --> 00:16:33.962
- How's Ammi?
- She's fine.


00:16:34.536 --> 00:16:36.766
lt's not easy to get over these things.


00:16:38.206 --> 00:16:39.195
How've you been?


00:16:39.574 --> 00:16:40.472
l'm good.


00:16:40.542 --> 00:16:41.877
Pretty good actually.


00:16:41.877 --> 00:16:44.004
l've a new apartment.
Three bedrooms, big space.


00:16:44.746 --> 00:16:45.747
Nice.


00:16:45.747 --> 00:16:48.049
l can't believe we're together again.


00:16:48.049 --> 00:16:49.744
- Yeah.
- Finally!


00:16:50.118 --> 00:16:51.016
Should we sit?


00:16:52.053 --> 00:16:53.884
So, here is the plan.


00:16:54.389 --> 00:16:55.590
First...


00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:58.150
we go to Costa Brava,
which is my choice.


00:16:59.027 --> 00:17:00.756
Then Arjun wants to go to Seville.


00:17:01.396 --> 00:17:02.798
And then we'll head to...


00:17:02.798 --> 00:17:04.322
Pampalona which you've chosen.


00:17:04.399 --> 00:17:06.594
Tomorrow morning we leave for
Costa Brava.


00:17:13.141 --> 00:17:14.369
What are you doing with the laptop?


00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:16.278
l'm looking for an address.


00:17:16.278 --> 00:17:17.575
Hola Kabira.


00:17:20.949 --> 00:17:22.439
Kabira...


00:17:22.851 --> 00:17:23.909
Your treasure.


00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.815
Brilliant. Thanks a ton.


00:17:31.026 --> 00:17:32.687
What have you done to this?


00:17:33.094 --> 00:17:34.152
Dude!


00:17:34.229 --> 00:17:37.899
First of all, be thankful that
l bought this 12,000 Euro bag for you!


00:17:37.899 --> 00:17:38.797
What?


00:17:40.268 --> 00:17:40.927
Here... show, show...


00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.371
12,000 Euro for this purse?


00:17:47.876 --> 00:17:49.207
Way more than your salary.


00:17:52.614 --> 00:17:53.171
What?


00:17:54.349 --> 00:17:55.839
Natasha loves these bags.


00:17:56.284 --> 00:17:57.512
And l love cars, Kabir.


00:17:58.286 --> 00:17:59.480
Always remember.


00:17:59.554 --> 00:18:01.613
lf you ever want to gift
me an expensive car...


00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:03.358
don't hesitate.


00:18:03.358 --> 00:18:04.793
l won't.


00:18:04.793 --> 00:18:05.316
Good.


00:18:05.393 --> 00:18:06.394
Let's go.


00:18:06.394 --> 00:18:07.725
l can't.


00:18:08.463 --> 00:18:10.298
l need to make some calls.


00:18:10.298 --> 00:18:11.094
l'll see you guys later.


00:18:12.534 --> 00:18:13.899
Adios amigos.


00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.265
- l thought this was a holiday.
- Me too.


00:18:17.973 --> 00:18:19.634
Let's go.


00:18:19.908 --> 00:18:20.875
We take the next right.


00:18:25.046 --> 00:18:26.513
- Looks quite old.
- There it is.


00:18:30.452 --> 00:18:31.612
There is the cathedral.


00:18:32.954 --> 00:18:35.013
- Do you know where this place is?
- Yes, straight ahead.


00:18:35.423 --> 00:18:36.913
How far is this gallery?


00:18:37.759 --> 00:18:38.726
Shut up!


00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:40.357
lt's just here.


00:18:41.029 --> 00:18:43.429
This is the street.
Catonia... whatever.


00:18:45.467 --> 00:18:46.661
And that's the place.


00:18:46.735 --> 00:18:47.895
l guess.


00:18:59.714 --> 00:19:00.908
Hey!


00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.478
Salman Habib.


00:19:06.555 --> 00:19:07.749
lt's a desi name.


00:19:08.723 --> 00:19:10.452
He must be Pakistani or lndian.


00:19:26.207 --> 00:19:27.003
Thanks.


00:19:31.546 --> 00:19:33.048
l wish you'd come with us.


00:19:33.048 --> 00:19:35.209
We walked all over
looking for his gallery.


00:19:35.784 --> 00:19:37.513
Man, this city is beautiful.


00:19:37.586 --> 00:19:40.612
Well, today l made
a 2,000 Pound commission, so...


00:19:40.689 --> 00:19:42.054
excuse me if l don't complain.


00:19:42.791 --> 00:19:43.519
Cheers.


00:19:43.592 --> 00:19:45.059
- 2,000 Pounds?
- Yup!


00:19:45.427 --> 00:19:45.893
Cheers.


00:19:50.532 --> 00:19:51.499
Dude...


00:19:52.067 --> 00:19:53.398
l heard something about you.


00:19:54.603 --> 00:19:55.297
What?


00:19:57.606 --> 00:19:58.664
You know what it is.


00:20:00.609 --> 00:20:01.439
Mom told you?


00:20:04.312 --> 00:20:05.438
Yes.


00:20:07.282 --> 00:20:09.750
But did she tell you l was forced?


00:20:10.018 --> 00:20:11.576
- Okay?
- Okay.


00:20:13.021 --> 00:20:15.012
God man!
She can't keep anything to herself.


00:20:15.924 --> 00:20:17.118
She's driving me crazy, man.


00:20:17.859 --> 00:20:18.560
Yeah.


00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.228
She came to London a few days ago.


00:20:20.228 --> 00:20:22.397
And dragged me to
some friend's relative's place.


00:20:22.397 --> 00:20:23.227
To see a girl.


00:20:24.099 --> 00:20:26.829
Neelu aunty and
Gogi uncle's daughter Cookie.


00:20:27.202 --> 00:20:30.035
l'd decided that l'd go,
have some tea...


00:20:30.238 --> 00:20:33.105
exchange pleasantries and
decline the match.


00:20:34.442 --> 00:20:36.444
As l took the first sip...


00:20:36.444 --> 00:20:37.672
Cookie said 'no'!


00:20:38.213 --> 00:20:39.237
So... you know...


00:20:39.881 --> 00:20:40.582
What?!


00:20:40.582 --> 00:20:42.243
l mean, so what!
What is there?


00:20:47.689 --> 00:20:48.383
What?


00:20:51.192 --> 00:20:52.659
Come on, man!


00:20:53.928 --> 00:20:56.158
You were set up for
an arranged marriage...


00:20:56.231 --> 00:20:57.465
and you got rejected?


00:20:57.465 --> 00:20:59.797
But l didn't even try
to create an impression.


00:20:59.868 --> 00:21:01.736
- Now you're just saying it.
- l didn't want to impress her!


00:21:01.736 --> 00:21:03.067
You've ruined our reputation.


00:21:03.605 --> 00:21:05.971
Shut up, please stop it!


00:21:07.075 --> 00:21:09.703
Why did she have to tell you?
What's wrong with her?


00:21:10.578 --> 00:21:12.914
Actually, your mom said nothing.


00:21:12.914 --> 00:21:16.384
lt's his latest trick.
And you're his latest victim.


00:21:16.384 --> 00:21:17.408
- Cheers!


00:21:18.286 --> 00:21:19.344
2,000 Pounds!


00:21:23.124 --> 00:21:25.354
Grow up, man!


00:21:26.695 --> 00:21:28.094
How old are you?


00:21:30.098 --> 00:21:30.655
You know what...


00:21:31.066 --> 00:21:32.634
we have to have some shots.


00:21:32.634 --> 00:21:34.966
- One for Cookie.
- We'll raise a toast to Cookie.


00:21:35.036 --> 00:21:36.094
Okay.


00:21:37.906 --> 00:21:39.574
Not for me.


00:21:39.574 --> 00:21:41.064
l have a conference call
in an hour.


00:21:41.476 --> 00:21:43.034
Same old plan?


00:21:43.111 --> 00:21:44.738
Mint money and retire at 40?


00:21:45.113 --> 00:21:46.137
Yup!


00:21:46.214 --> 00:21:47.112
That's the plan.


00:21:57.792 --> 00:21:59.627
Listen...


00:21:59.627 --> 00:22:00.651
thank you.


00:22:01.362 --> 00:22:02.329
For what?


00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:05.155
For coming on this trip.
lt means a lot to me.


00:22:07.635 --> 00:22:09.262
l'm sure it does.


00:22:16.878 --> 00:22:18.413
Literacy is the key.


00:22:18.413 --> 00:22:20.040
lt's not that simple.


00:22:20.882 --> 00:22:23.851
Oh - my - God!


00:22:29.257 --> 00:22:32.385
Kabira, amazing choice.


00:22:32.761 --> 00:22:35.321
She's gorgeous but she isn't ours.


00:22:36.397 --> 00:22:37.386
What?


00:22:38.032 --> 00:22:39.590
An SUV will be a lot comfortable.


00:22:40.368 --> 00:22:43.098
To hell with the comfort.
Just look at her!


00:22:46.941 --> 00:22:48.135
Guys?


00:22:49.377 --> 00:22:52.147
- Hola, good morning.
Your name?


00:22:52.147 --> 00:22:53.114
- Kabir Dewan.
- Guys!


00:22:53.982 --> 00:22:55.677
Kabir... Arjun...


00:22:56.384 --> 00:22:57.578
She's beautiful.


00:23:00.722 --> 00:23:03.714
l've booked an SUV and
they've charged me, sorry.


00:23:04.459 --> 00:23:05.824
Sell Natasha's purse.


00:23:07.095 --> 00:23:08.062
Funny.


00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:09.924
Please!


00:23:10.431 --> 00:23:12.899
What are you doing?
Behave yourself!


00:23:15.036 --> 00:23:17.027
Oh, don't even
think about it, dude.


00:23:17.739 --> 00:23:20.207
All my life l sat in your car.


00:23:21.643 --> 00:23:23.042
Now it's my turn.


00:23:25.713 --> 00:23:27.615
What are you doing?


00:23:27.615 --> 00:23:30.015
12,000 Euro. She rides first class.


00:24:33.815 --> 00:24:36.613
Hey Sarah, what's up?
Mr. Yamamoto called?


00:24:38.453 --> 00:24:40.318
Well, he'll have
the docket in two days.


00:24:41.723 --> 00:24:44.954
No, no don't say l'm on a holiday.
Just get Joe to call me back. Bye.


00:24:50.899 --> 00:24:52.389
Hey Joe, what's up?


00:24:53.201 --> 00:24:54.759
Like... 'now' now?


00:24:56.604 --> 00:25:00.506
Yeah, okay.
Yeah, l'll do it, bye.


00:25:08.616 --> 00:25:09.810
Sorry guys.


00:25:24.198 --> 00:25:27.031
Guys... ten minutes tops!


00:25:29.537 --> 00:25:30.765
Moshi moshi, Arjun-san.


00:25:31.306 --> 00:25:33.103
Moshi moshi, Yamamoto-san.


00:25:35.209 --> 00:25:37.078
How are you?


00:25:37.078 --> 00:25:38.773
l'm fine, thank you.


00:25:39.914 --> 00:25:41.245
Moshi, moshi?.


00:25:42.383 --> 00:25:43.782
lt's Japanese for hello.


00:25:44.052 --> 00:25:46.418
- l assure you,
l will always be here for you.


00:25:49.924 --> 00:25:51.289
Kabira...


00:25:51.359 --> 00:25:53.054
look at this amazing view.


00:25:53.962 --> 00:25:55.657
And, now look at our friend.


00:25:56.264 --> 00:25:58.266
My team is going to
put together all the information.


00:25:58.266 --> 00:25:59.824
And you will have
the docket with you in three days.


00:26:01.602 --> 00:26:02.591
What happened to him, dude?


00:26:04.605 --> 00:26:06.129
lf you ask me...


00:26:06.207 --> 00:26:08.038
he has become mantally sick.


00:26:08.943 --> 00:26:11.503
And he needs the psychaitrixt.


00:26:13.047 --> 00:26:14.241
lsn't this from school?


00:26:14.615 --> 00:26:15.843
Not school.


00:26:15.917 --> 00:26:18.408
- Eschool!
- Eschool.


00:26:18.686 --> 00:26:19.420
Eschoo!.


00:26:19.420 --> 00:26:22.821
Because only the Mr. the Dubey
can the talk like this.


00:26:23.257 --> 00:26:25.452
The Mr. the Dubey.


00:26:25.526 --> 00:26:29.826
Are you mantally challanged my buy?


00:26:31.265 --> 00:26:32.232
Not buy.


00:26:33.868 --> 00:26:34.702
bwoy.


00:26:34.702 --> 00:26:36.871
- bwoy.


00:26:36.871 --> 00:26:38.773
Mantally challangedmy bwoy...


00:26:38.773 --> 00:26:39.762
Mantal bwoy.


00:26:41.876 --> 00:26:42.774
Thank you, Mr. Yamamoto.


00:26:45.546 --> 00:26:47.275
Let's go. l'm done.


00:26:47.548 --> 00:26:48.606
Arjun, my bwoy...


00:26:49.117 --> 00:26:51.950
you look the mantalin this the uniform!


00:26:53.855 --> 00:26:54.719
Let's go.


00:26:55.890 --> 00:26:58.017
Okay, the very the well the saids.


00:27:22.517 --> 00:27:24.085
Guys...


00:27:24.085 --> 00:27:25.916
just do as l say.


00:27:26.921 --> 00:27:29.757
lt's been ten years since college.
Please grow up.


00:27:29.757 --> 00:27:32.317
- Don't do this, please.
- Trust me.


00:27:32.393 --> 00:27:34.293
You'll kiss me later.


00:27:35.029 --> 00:27:36.597
When l shout...


00:27:36.597 --> 00:27:39.794
point to the urinal and
scream loudly.


00:27:58.719 --> 00:27:59.947
Bye!


00:28:06.694 --> 00:28:08.753
Dude, you're the mantallythe sick!


00:28:10.131 --> 00:28:12.691
People are the same everywhere.


00:28:12.767 --> 00:28:14.257
lt's just human nature.


00:28:20.141 --> 00:28:20.835
What are you doing?


00:28:23.277 --> 00:28:24.938
Poor thing's feeling hot.


00:28:26.547 --> 00:28:27.343
Poor thing?


00:28:27.615 --> 00:28:28.843
Kabira...


00:28:29.884 --> 00:28:32.182
meet Bagwati.


00:28:34.555 --> 00:28:37.046
What's happened to your jokes?


00:28:37.258 --> 00:28:38.555
Are they sick?


00:28:39.393 --> 00:28:42.191
Well, they've taken after you.


00:28:42.463 --> 00:28:44.954
Hey Joe, yes l spoke to
Mr. Yamamoto and...


00:28:45.733 --> 00:28:47.758
Somebody please
throw his phone out.


00:28:50.438 --> 00:28:51.462
What the...


00:28:53.641 --> 00:28:54.608
-Are you mad?


00:28:56.777 --> 00:28:57.766
Did you just...


00:29:09.590 --> 00:29:10.318
You think we'll get it?


00:29:14.562 --> 00:29:17.265
Sorry, l didn't think he would do it.


00:29:17.265 --> 00:29:18.960
Of course you didn't know, Kabir.


00:29:20.101 --> 00:29:21.227
Now go find my phone.


00:29:21.636 --> 00:29:22.660
- Where?
- l don't know.


00:29:22.737 --> 00:29:24.034
l want my phone, that's all.


00:29:24.305 --> 00:29:25.139
lt could've broken.


00:29:25.139 --> 00:29:27.334
Arjun, don't be silly...
we won't find it.


00:29:27.408 --> 00:29:28.238
Silly?


00:29:28.809 --> 00:29:31.039
You threw my phone out
of a moving car, you moron!


00:29:31.812 --> 00:29:34.007
He said it, l threw it.


00:29:34.081 --> 00:29:34.570
Didn't you?


00:29:34.782 --> 00:29:36.147
Kabir...


00:29:36.217 --> 00:29:37.775
please tell me to slap him.


00:29:37.852 --> 00:29:38.753
Don't be silly.


00:29:38.753 --> 00:29:39.651
Just tell me to slap him.


00:29:40.054 --> 00:29:41.419
Just tell me to slap him.


00:29:42.056 --> 00:29:42.852
Slap him.


00:29:45.893 --> 00:29:46.689
- What's wrong with you?
- Guys!


00:29:47.628 --> 00:29:49.493
l'll get you a new phone.
l was just joking.


00:29:49.630 --> 00:29:51.299
Well, it's not funny.


00:29:51.299 --> 00:29:52.926
That call was important.


00:29:53.701 --> 00:29:56.932
You think being 'cool and funny'
gives you the license to do anything?


00:29:57.371 --> 00:29:59.540
lt's always like,
'lmran said this. He's so funny.'


00:29:59.540 --> 00:30:01.309
lmran did that, he is so cool'.


00:30:01.309 --> 00:30:02.643
Grow up!


00:30:02.643 --> 00:30:04.634
Throwing my phone
out the window is not funny!


00:30:04.712 --> 00:30:08.011
Hooking up with my girlfriend
was not funny!


00:30:13.888 --> 00:30:14.855
Listen...


00:30:15.389 --> 00:30:16.947
it's been four years.


00:30:17.024 --> 00:30:18.593
And l've apologised for it.


00:30:18.593 --> 00:30:20.151
Now let it go.


00:30:20.795 --> 00:30:22.194
Or what? Huh, what?


00:30:22.863 --> 00:30:24.694
Stop it. Stop it, you two.


00:30:26.400 --> 00:30:27.594
You're behaving like kids.


00:30:29.937 --> 00:30:31.495
lf there's a problem,
deal with it.


00:30:31.572 --> 00:30:32.197
Like adults.


00:30:32.573 --> 00:30:33.733
Who made you the judge?


00:30:34.075 --> 00:30:35.142
Do you see anyone else here?


00:30:35.142 --> 00:30:35.870
Listen.


00:30:36.210 --> 00:30:37.778
Let's get this straight.


00:30:37.778 --> 00:30:38.938
l don't have any problem with him.


00:30:40.715 --> 00:30:42.750
Why would you have a problem?


00:30:42.750 --> 00:30:44.149
Sonali was my girlfriend.


00:30:44.452 --> 00:30:46.010
Come on, Sonali and me
fell in love.


00:30:47.388 --> 00:30:48.787
lt happens. Shit happens.


00:30:49.724 --> 00:30:50.122
Yeah.


00:30:51.359 --> 00:30:52.155
lt was shit.


00:30:53.227 --> 00:30:54.023
For me.


00:30:55.129 --> 00:30:57.495
And l'm sure you didn't
give it a second thought.


00:30:59.700 --> 00:31:00.860
lmran man...


00:31:01.969 --> 00:31:04.028
l would never do that to you.


00:31:04.372 --> 00:31:05.168
Arjun...


00:31:05.740 --> 00:31:07.935
l screwed up.
Now what do you want me to do?


00:31:08.542 --> 00:31:09.201
What do l do?


00:31:09.410 --> 00:31:10.741
Should l wear a 'Sorry, Arjun' t-shirt
and walk around?


00:31:11.112 --> 00:31:11.737
What should l do?


00:31:13.314 --> 00:31:13.973
Just look at him.


00:31:15.383 --> 00:31:16.748
Listen to me, okay.
You two, please!


00:31:17.418 --> 00:31:18.407
Sonali was a bitch.


00:31:19.387 --> 00:31:19.910
Understand?


00:31:20.087 --> 00:31:21.418
l'm sorry, really.


00:31:21.622 --> 00:31:23.180
She used you.


00:31:23.257 --> 00:31:24.656
Then gave you a BPL
and used him.


00:31:25.092 --> 00:31:26.423
And she dumped you as well.


00:31:27.028 --> 00:31:29.496
She was a waste of time then
and she is a waste of time now.


00:31:30.298 --> 00:31:33.631
Four years ago we cancelled
this trip because of her.


00:31:33.701 --> 00:31:36.693
Today we're here for me.
Don't let her ruin this.


00:31:36.937 --> 00:31:37.801
Please!


00:31:39.607 --> 00:31:41.097
How many times
do l have to apologise?


00:31:42.710 --> 00:31:44.575
How many times?
Let's just make it clear.


00:31:46.280 --> 00:31:48.748
Till it doesn't come from here.


00:31:55.723 --> 00:31:56.747
What's BPL?


00:31:57.692 --> 00:31:58.556
Bum Pe Laat.
[Kick in the arse.]


00:32:05.866 --> 00:32:06.901
You're crazy.


00:32:06.901 --> 00:32:09.426
Speak with him.
He slapped me.


00:32:11.739 --> 00:32:12.797
l can't believe this.


00:32:26.454 --> 00:32:27.819
Hi baby...


00:32:28.923 --> 00:32:29.651
Good.


00:32:30.758 --> 00:32:32.316
We've left Barcelona.


00:32:33.594 --> 00:32:34.891
On the road.


00:32:35.796 --> 00:32:37.320
Yes, it's beautiful.


00:32:38.632 --> 00:32:41.601
Of course, they're with me.
Where will they go?


00:32:43.771 --> 00:32:45.136
Everything is cool.


00:32:47.308 --> 00:32:48.275
Yeah.


00:33:05.359 --> 00:33:07.261
All ready.


00:33:07.261 --> 00:33:08.558
Come on.


00:33:10.965 --> 00:33:12.023
Yes!


00:33:12.099 --> 00:33:13.634
Now this is a house.


00:33:13.634 --> 00:33:15.329
- l like.
- Cool.


00:33:15.403 --> 00:33:16.604
lt's lovely.


00:33:16.604 --> 00:33:18.504
You haven't seen the half of it yet.


00:33:20.141 --> 00:33:21.165
Can we slide?


00:33:21.642 --> 00:33:22.540
No, you can't.


00:33:23.144 --> 00:33:24.311
- Captain.
-Amazing.


00:33:24.311 --> 00:33:25.642
Wow, man!


00:33:26.313 --> 00:33:27.974
This is nicer than the pictures.


00:33:33.587 --> 00:33:34.455
Amazing.


00:33:34.455 --> 00:33:35.444
What a view!


00:33:39.593 --> 00:33:40.753
Someday.


00:34:26.207 --> 00:34:27.374
How was it?


00:34:27.374 --> 00:34:28.398
Refreshing.


00:34:30.811 --> 00:34:32.540
Who is she?


00:34:32.613 --> 00:34:33.739
How should l know, dude?


00:34:36.116 --> 00:34:37.174
She's nice.


00:34:38.686 --> 00:34:40.017
Really nice.


00:34:42.890 --> 00:34:44.050
What's happening?


00:34:44.959 --> 00:34:46.620
She's got me.
She's pulling me towards her.


00:34:48.128 --> 00:34:49.026
She's pulling me.


00:34:49.096 --> 00:34:50.427
l saw her first.


00:34:51.932 --> 00:34:52.990
So true.


00:34:54.235 --> 00:34:56.897
But has she seen you?


00:34:59.807 --> 00:35:00.501
What?


00:35:02.243 --> 00:35:04.768
- Hola.
- Hola.


00:35:06.146 --> 00:35:06.805
Can l try that?


00:35:08.682 --> 00:35:09.080
Yeah.


00:35:09.783 --> 00:35:10.477
Thanks.


00:35:15.222 --> 00:35:16.724
Where are you from?


00:35:16.724 --> 00:35:17.452
Brazil?


00:35:18.692 --> 00:35:19.920
Half US, half lndia.


00:35:20.628 --> 00:35:21.322
lndia?


00:35:22.763 --> 00:35:24.230
What a coincidence!
Which part?


00:35:24.965 --> 00:35:27.195
My dad's from Delhi but
l live in London.


00:35:28.369 --> 00:35:29.927
Hindi? Not bad!


00:35:30.371 --> 00:35:32.362
You too... wow!


00:35:35.609 --> 00:35:38.578
lf you're free,
want to join me for a drink?


00:35:43.918 --> 00:35:44.907
l have an early morning.


00:35:46.086 --> 00:35:46.950
Sorry.


00:35:52.860 --> 00:35:53.827
Thanks.


00:36:03.437 --> 00:36:03.960
Bye.


00:36:08.475 --> 00:36:09.999
What's your name?


00:36:10.077 --> 00:36:10.873
Laila.


00:36:11.378 --> 00:36:12.072
lmran.


00:36:12.813 --> 00:36:15.509
But my friends call me 'Romeo'.


00:36:27.628 --> 00:36:28.796
Romeo?


00:36:28.796 --> 00:36:31.094
Seriously man... Romeo?


00:36:32.399 --> 00:36:33.798
l mean, chee!


00:36:34.301 --> 00:36:34.995
Arjun...


00:36:36.136 --> 00:36:38.104
lt's a man's duty to try.


00:36:38.939 --> 00:36:41.635
Success and failure are in His hands.


00:36:41.976 --> 00:36:43.637
Great, professor.


00:36:45.446 --> 00:36:46.606
Seriously?


00:36:46.914 --> 00:36:48.711
You got me this time!


00:36:59.693 --> 00:37:00.421
What the hell is this?


00:37:01.528 --> 00:37:02.324
What?


00:37:05.966 --> 00:37:07.297
This! What the hell is this?


00:37:07.701 --> 00:37:09.903
You said l had to
get you a new phone.


00:37:09.903 --> 00:37:11.097
You didn't specify which one.


00:37:11.705 --> 00:37:13.073
l'm a trader.


00:37:13.073 --> 00:37:14.267
Not a Japanese school girl.


00:37:15.209 --> 00:37:16.039
Moshi moshi.


00:37:17.378 --> 00:37:19.209
Shut up, just shut up!


00:37:19.613 --> 00:37:22.081
- Just don't talk to me.
- Guys that's enough!


00:37:23.017 --> 00:37:25.042
Look at this.
What's wrong with him?


00:37:26.120 --> 00:37:27.018
What's wrong with you?


00:37:27.388 --> 00:37:28.753
lt's funny.


00:37:29.857 --> 00:37:31.025
Anyway, now listen.


00:37:31.025 --> 00:37:32.652
Why we are here in Costa Brava.


00:37:33.961 --> 00:37:34.791
Ready for this?


00:37:35.729 --> 00:37:36.127
Yeah.


00:37:38.899 --> 00:37:40.093
Deep... sea...


00:37:40.768 --> 00:37:41.325
diving.


00:37:43.404 --> 00:37:44.063
What?


00:37:44.905 --> 00:37:47.066
Yes, our training begins
first thing tomorrow.


00:37:47.741 --> 00:37:49.410
l'm sorry but...


00:37:49.410 --> 00:37:51.578
why is this turning into a
let's torture Arjun holiday?


00:37:51.578 --> 00:37:52.946
l just don't understand.


00:37:52.946 --> 00:37:54.615
Relax, l know.


00:37:54.615 --> 00:37:56.515
l spoke with the people
at the diving school.


00:37:56.583 --> 00:37:58.585
You don't need to know how to swim.


00:37:58.585 --> 00:38:00.450
At least you know how to drown.


00:38:00.521 --> 00:38:02.923
Listen, just keep quiet. Just...


00:38:02.923 --> 00:38:04.083
keep quiet.


00:38:05.092 --> 00:38:05.820
Kabir...


00:38:06.060 --> 00:38:08.255
l don't understand how you thought
l'll do this.


00:38:08.562 --> 00:38:09.688
What's wrong with you?


00:38:17.037 --> 00:38:18.231
Bathroom... to the left.


00:38:26.480 --> 00:38:27.276
Okay, listen.


00:38:27.781 --> 00:38:30.341
l know you're scared of water.


00:38:30.551 --> 00:38:30.880
Okay.


00:38:31.218 --> 00:38:34.244
But then that's the challenge.
And it's completely safe.


00:38:34.688 --> 00:38:36.056
Think about it.


00:38:36.056 --> 00:38:37.614
Blue waters... okay?


00:38:37.691 --> 00:38:39.318
Fish swimming close to you.


00:38:40.027 --> 00:38:41.187
Corals...


00:38:42.863 --> 00:38:43.887
lt'll be amazing.


00:38:48.268 --> 00:38:51.260
Look, if you're not comfortable,
no one's going to force you.


00:38:52.473 --> 00:38:54.464
No, l'm serious, it's okay.


00:38:54.908 --> 00:38:56.239
Okay. Fine.


00:39:09.356 --> 00:39:09.913
Kabir Dewan?


00:39:11.892 --> 00:39:12.960
Laila?


00:39:12.960 --> 00:39:13.449
Hey.


00:39:13.527 --> 00:39:14.926
Hi, what are you doing here?


00:39:15.562 --> 00:39:17.086
Following you, l guess.


00:39:17.931 --> 00:39:18.761
Really?


00:39:19.466 --> 00:39:20.490
No.


00:39:20.934 --> 00:39:22.834
l'm here to train you.


00:39:23.070 --> 00:39:23.934
l'm an instructor here.


00:39:24.471 --> 00:39:25.165
Wow!


00:39:26.073 --> 00:39:28.275
- Hi, l'm Kabir.
- Laila.


00:39:28.275 --> 00:39:29.674
- This is Arjun.
- Hi.


00:39:29.743 --> 00:39:30.209
Laila.


00:39:32.579 --> 00:39:33.102
Romeo?


00:39:34.114 --> 00:39:34.842
You remember?


00:39:36.917 --> 00:39:38.285
Arjun...


00:39:38.285 --> 00:39:41.743
lf you don't want to dive,
it's totally fine.


00:39:43.223 --> 00:39:44.281
He can't swim.


00:39:46.894 --> 00:39:48.225
lt's okay, doesn't matter.


00:39:48.862 --> 00:39:49.829
You'll be fine.


00:39:51.765 --> 00:39:52.390
Thank you.


00:39:53.767 --> 00:39:54.825
Shall we start?


00:39:55.536 --> 00:39:56.400
Let's go.


00:39:56.970 --> 00:39:58.995
lt's a little difficult to
talk under water.


00:39:59.072 --> 00:40:00.539
For obvious reasons.


00:40:00.741 --> 00:40:02.299
So these signs are very important.


00:40:03.777 --> 00:40:04.641
Up.


00:40:06.079 --> 00:40:07.341
Down.


00:40:08.115 --> 00:40:09.446
Okay.


00:40:10.250 --> 00:40:11.410
Not okay.


00:40:12.753 --> 00:40:13.913
Air guage.


00:40:15.722 --> 00:40:16.279
Okay?


00:40:18.392 --> 00:40:19.051
Okay?


00:40:21.461 --> 00:40:22.086
Alright!


00:40:24.698 --> 00:40:26.393
You have to wear a wet suit.


00:40:27.034 --> 00:40:28.058
The water is pretty cold.


00:40:29.303 --> 00:40:32.204
Next is the BCD.
Your buoyancy control device.


00:40:33.640 --> 00:40:34.664
All okay?


00:40:35.909 --> 00:40:38.537
These weights will help you
remain underwater.


00:40:45.419 --> 00:40:47.148
Finally, your fins.


00:42:17.544 --> 00:42:18.812
Cheers. Salut.


00:42:18.812 --> 00:42:19.710
Good job, boys.


00:42:25.619 --> 00:42:26.950
So, when is the wedding?


00:42:28.755 --> 00:42:29.790
ln two months.


00:42:29.790 --> 00:42:32.452
- That's like now, man.
- Yeah, l know.


00:42:32.526 --> 00:42:35.017
We only started dating
about six months ago.


00:42:35.462 --> 00:42:36.622
Well, you know what they say...


00:42:36.697 --> 00:42:37.721
when it's right, it's right.


00:42:38.098 --> 00:42:39.087
That's what l said.


00:42:39.700 --> 00:42:40.530
Actually, she said it.


00:42:43.737 --> 00:42:44.533
What does she do?


00:42:44.972 --> 00:42:46.803
lnterior design.
And she's bloody good.


00:42:47.474 --> 00:42:48.202
Okay.


00:42:48.275 --> 00:42:50.004
And of course,
her father has a hotel business...


00:42:50.077 --> 00:42:51.271
that's evaluated at...


00:42:52.045 --> 00:42:53.171
Ten billion?


00:42:53.647 --> 00:42:54.477
Ten billion.


00:42:55.749 --> 00:42:58.479
l'm not marrying her for her money.


00:42:58.552 --> 00:43:00.454
Kabir, of course not.


00:43:00.454 --> 00:43:02.513
But you've got to admit,
it's a plus point.


00:43:03.090 --> 00:43:05.581
Plus point?
Are you serious?


00:43:06.059 --> 00:43:08.619
Would you marry for money?


00:43:09.429 --> 00:43:10.293
Depends.


00:43:10.764 --> 00:43:11.662
How much?


00:43:13.700 --> 00:43:14.758
Ten billion!


00:43:15.736 --> 00:43:16.634
Definitely.


00:43:17.471 --> 00:43:19.336
And what if she's a bore?


00:43:20.874 --> 00:43:25.208
When you have ten billion in your bank
who needs the wife for entertainment?


00:43:25.379 --> 00:43:27.677
- Romantic.
- l agree, it's true.


00:43:28.048 --> 00:43:29.538
- Cheers!


00:43:32.352 --> 00:43:33.376
Are you seeing someone?


00:43:35.022 --> 00:43:36.148
Do you have a girlfriend?


00:43:36.790 --> 00:43:37.779
No.


00:43:39.359 --> 00:43:41.728
Hey... what about Rohini?
What happened there?


00:43:41.728 --> 00:43:43.797
- She was nice.
- Well...


00:43:43.797 --> 00:43:45.992
l guess she wanted
different things out of life.


00:43:46.733 --> 00:43:47.700
Laila...


00:43:48.468 --> 00:43:51.494
apart from my body
what else do you want out of life?


00:43:57.077 --> 00:44:00.376
l don't know.
l haven't really made a list.


00:44:00.714 --> 00:44:01.681
Still...


00:44:02.682 --> 00:44:04.172
there must be something.


00:44:07.120 --> 00:44:10.248
l guess, l want that...


00:44:10.624 --> 00:44:12.956
life should continue to surprise me.


00:44:13.560 --> 00:44:14.720
lnspire me.


00:44:16.863 --> 00:44:18.262
Make me meet new people.


00:44:18.432 --> 00:44:19.126
Hola.


00:44:20.567 --> 00:44:21.397
Hola.


00:44:22.369 --> 00:44:23.199
Hola?


00:44:23.937 --> 00:44:24.926
Sorry.


00:44:25.705 --> 00:44:27.002
Give me new experiences.


00:44:27.641 --> 00:44:28.665
And...


00:44:29.776 --> 00:44:30.902
l want...


00:44:32.279 --> 00:44:33.507
you to get me a drink.


00:44:36.016 --> 00:44:37.005
Your wish is my command.


00:44:37.184 --> 00:44:38.651
- One for me, please.
- Arjun?


00:44:39.419 --> 00:44:40.477
l'm okay.


00:44:47.594 --> 00:44:50.654
- Keep it down.
- Guys we're gonna get arrested.


00:44:54.935 --> 00:44:56.664
He's here. Quiet.


00:44:59.773 --> 00:45:01.263
l was just telling...


00:45:02.109 --> 00:45:04.771
that's the problem you see.


00:45:18.625 --> 00:45:19.649
Sorry.


00:45:43.783 --> 00:45:45.614
Your life is about to change.


00:45:48.121 --> 00:45:49.247
That's if l survive!


00:45:52.392 --> 00:45:53.381
We'll see.


00:45:56.963 --> 00:45:58.521
Yup, we'll see.


00:49:47.026 --> 00:49:49.551
The moment flows by like molten sapphire


00:49:51.898 --> 00:49:54.093
Deep blue silences


00:49:55.969 --> 00:49:58.870
No earth below, no sky above


00:50:01.207 --> 00:50:04.233
The rustling branches and leaves


00:50:06.379 --> 00:50:08.745
Are saying only you are here


00:50:11.184 --> 00:50:12.208
Only me


00:50:13.520 --> 00:50:15.511
My breath and my heartbeat


00:50:17.924 --> 00:50:20.757
Such depth, such solitude


00:50:22.429 --> 00:50:23.953
And me


00:50:24.364 --> 00:50:25.228
Only me


00:50:26.933 --> 00:50:29.265
I now believe I exist


00:50:42.248 --> 00:50:45.547
Baby, it was amazing.
You should definitely do it.


00:50:45.919 --> 00:50:47.580
l have no interest.


00:50:48.087 --> 00:50:48.955
Hey!


00:50:48.955 --> 00:50:49.614
Hey...


00:50:49.689 --> 00:50:52.157
Sorry. Can l use your loo?
lmran is taking a shower.


00:50:52.459 --> 00:50:53.084
Sure.


00:50:53.860 --> 00:50:54.724
Who is that?


00:50:55.128 --> 00:50:56.493
Wait. First say hi to Natasha.


00:50:57.897 --> 00:50:58.864
Okay.


00:50:59.799 --> 00:51:01.630
Hey... l'm Laila.


00:51:03.303 --> 00:51:03.997
Hi.


00:51:04.304 --> 00:51:06.636
Kabir has told me a lot about you.


00:51:06.706 --> 00:51:08.071
Congratulations in advance.


00:51:08.608 --> 00:51:09.506
Thanks.


00:51:09.909 --> 00:51:11.900
Well, it's really nice to meet you.


00:51:12.645 --> 00:51:14.670
- Bye.
- Bye.


00:51:16.549 --> 00:51:17.538
Who is that?


00:51:18.184 --> 00:51:19.552
That's Laila, our instructor.


00:51:19.552 --> 00:51:21.054
She's studying fashion in London but...


00:51:21.054 --> 00:51:23.957
three months a year she works
at dive sites around the world.


00:51:23.957 --> 00:51:25.124
lsn't that cool?


00:51:25.124 --> 00:51:25.959
Very cool.


00:51:25.959 --> 00:51:27.756
What is she doing in your room?


00:51:28.127 --> 00:51:29.492
She's using the bathroom.


00:51:33.099 --> 00:51:35.635
lmran invited her over for dinner.


00:51:35.635 --> 00:51:37.796
To celebrate our first dive.


00:51:38.238 --> 00:51:39.296
D'you think l'm stupid?


00:51:39.639 --> 00:51:41.539
What? lt's the truth.


00:51:41.608 --> 00:51:42.632
Arjun is cooking.


00:51:42.876 --> 00:51:45.037
Yeah, you must be very busy.
l'll speak to you later.


00:51:45.712 --> 00:51:47.270
Natasha, why are you getting upset?


00:51:47.580 --> 00:51:49.775
l'm not upset.
l've a flight to catch.


00:51:50.550 --> 00:51:51.881
You're being really silly.


00:51:52.018 --> 00:51:53.042
Yeah, l know. Bye.


00:51:55.455 --> 00:51:56.319
Bye.


00:51:59.692 --> 00:52:02.593
- All okay?
- Yeah, fine.


00:52:03.129 --> 00:52:04.994
- See you downstairs.
- See you.


00:52:16.042 --> 00:52:18.411
Need some help?


00:52:18.411 --> 00:52:20.106
Nope. Almost done.


00:52:23.850 --> 00:52:25.184
Paella.


00:52:25.184 --> 00:52:26.151
- Yup.
- Very nice.


00:52:26.853 --> 00:52:27.717
Thanks.


00:52:32.959 --> 00:52:33.926
So...


00:52:34.694 --> 00:52:36.252
you didn't tell me how it was.


00:52:39.465 --> 00:52:40.432
Thank you.


00:52:40.934 --> 00:52:43.767
Don't thank me.
You did it.


00:52:45.438 --> 00:52:48.407
So, how was it?


00:52:51.611 --> 00:52:52.942
lt was magical.


00:52:55.181 --> 00:52:57.706
lt felt like the
most peaceful place on earth.


00:53:00.219 --> 00:53:01.379
lt was beautiful.


00:53:03.056 --> 00:53:05.547
l was 16 when l did my first dive.


00:53:06.025 --> 00:53:08.926
And then stopping myself
was impossible.


00:53:09.796 --> 00:53:11.627
Yeah, it could be addictive.


00:53:12.098 --> 00:53:12.894
Addictive?


00:53:13.633 --> 00:53:14.622
No.


00:53:15.034 --> 00:53:16.592
Addiction is such a negative word.


00:53:17.270 --> 00:53:18.430
Diving is...


00:53:19.105 --> 00:53:20.402
something else for me.


00:53:20.907 --> 00:53:22.636
lt's like meditation.


00:53:23.876 --> 00:53:27.903
You're conscious of
every breath, every moment.


00:53:28.615 --> 00:53:30.014
Just imagine...


00:53:30.083 --> 00:53:32.415
living your whole life like that.


00:53:33.086 --> 00:53:35.486
Be fully alive to each and every moment.


00:53:39.626 --> 00:53:40.524
Delicious.


00:53:40.593 --> 00:53:41.457
- Seriously.
- Thank you.


00:53:41.527 --> 00:53:42.585
You should cook more often.


00:53:42.962 --> 00:53:43.986
l know man but...


00:53:44.364 --> 00:53:45.422
where's the time!


00:53:49.402 --> 00:53:51.529
So, the fear of water still there?


00:53:52.572 --> 00:53:53.539
Now there's no fear.


00:53:54.607 --> 00:53:55.631
Not even of life.


00:53:57.810 --> 00:54:00.438
Wow! ln one dunk
you've unravelled the mystery of life!


00:54:00.913 --> 00:54:01.641
Well done, my lad.


00:54:03.683 --> 00:54:05.173
Actually, it's quite simple.


00:54:06.419 --> 00:54:07.386
What is it?


00:54:09.922 --> 00:54:10.889
Just...


00:54:12.125 --> 00:54:13.092
keep breathing.


00:54:19.599 --> 00:54:20.793
Laila!


00:54:21.601 --> 00:54:24.001
Finally, our old friend has surfaced.


00:54:24.971 --> 00:54:26.996
And to avoid a relapse...


00:54:27.440 --> 00:54:29.499
why don't you join us on the trip?


00:54:30.143 --> 00:54:31.303
l'd love to.


00:54:31.377 --> 00:54:32.901
But l'm off to Bunol tomorrow.


00:54:33.312 --> 00:54:34.745
lt's the Tomatina festival.


00:54:34.914 --> 00:54:35.812
- Too bad!
- ls it?


00:54:35.882 --> 00:54:37.784
Toma-tina, what's that?


00:54:37.784 --> 00:54:39.115
Arjun!


00:54:39.585 --> 00:54:41.287
How can you not know that...


00:54:41.287 --> 00:54:44.848
it is world s largest tomato fight?!


00:54:47.026 --> 00:54:49.762
lt's like our festival of colours.
But played with tomatoes instead.


00:54:49.762 --> 00:54:50.763
Really?


00:54:50.763 --> 00:54:53.299
Actually, you guys should come.


00:54:53.299 --> 00:54:54.493
lt'll be a blast.


00:54:55.968 --> 00:54:56.491
l'm in.


00:54:56.903 --> 00:54:57.970
-Are you serious?
- Yeah, l'm in.


00:54:57.970 --> 00:54:59.699
What? No!


00:54:59.772 --> 00:55:00.973
We're leaving for Seville tomorrow.


00:55:00.973 --> 00:55:02.702
That's perfect.
Bunol is en-route.


00:55:03.209 --> 00:55:04.403
- Come on.


00:55:05.478 --> 00:55:07.844
Look, Seville is Arjun's choice.


00:55:08.614 --> 00:55:09.740
He made the reservations.


00:55:11.284 --> 00:55:14.276
To mess with Arjun's reservations is...


00:55:14.353 --> 00:55:15.820
like inviting Death!


00:55:22.028 --> 00:55:22.926
Come on.


00:55:27.100 --> 00:55:29.625
Alright, let me see what l can do.


00:55:33.473 --> 00:55:34.667
ls that your phone?


00:55:40.880 --> 00:55:41.869
lt's a long story.


00:55:42.782 --> 00:55:43.771
Let's not go there.


00:55:43.850 --> 00:55:45.147
No, it's nice.


00:55:46.119 --> 00:55:47.620
He's very much in touch
with his feminine side.


00:55:47.620 --> 00:55:48.678
Eat your food.


00:55:48.755 --> 00:55:51.257
Don't worry, even l like pink.


00:55:51.257 --> 00:55:52.656
Great, l feel much better.
Thank you.


00:56:00.767 --> 00:56:01.927
How could you do this?


00:56:02.435 --> 00:56:04.303
Rohini, l'm really sorry but...


00:56:04.303 --> 00:56:05.998
can't you see that
this deal could help me.


00:56:06.072 --> 00:56:07.801
Can't you see that maybe l don't care!


00:56:07.940 --> 00:56:09.142
You don't care.


00:56:09.142 --> 00:56:11.372
- You don't care about my life?
- Stop it, Arjun.


00:56:11.444 --> 00:56:13.844
Don't confuse your work with your life.


00:56:14.080 --> 00:56:17.106
Your work isn't your life.
lt's just a part of it.


00:56:17.450 --> 00:56:20.453
Just like this relationship
is a part of your life.


00:56:20.453 --> 00:56:22.353
- What about this?
- What about this?


00:56:22.889 --> 00:56:25.289
l bought this apartment so that
we could live together.


00:56:25.358 --> 00:56:27.260
What? Please!


00:56:27.260 --> 00:56:31.764
You bought this apartment to impress people
with your up market address.


00:56:31.764 --> 00:56:33.432
l can't believe you just said that.


00:56:33.432 --> 00:56:36.629
- l'm planning a future with you.
- Our future will come tomorrow, Arjun.


00:56:36.702 --> 00:56:38.738
- Don't scream!
- Where is our today?


00:56:38.738 --> 00:56:39.906
Don't scream.


00:56:39.906 --> 00:56:41.032
Then listen to me.


00:56:43.409 --> 00:56:44.467
What do you want?


00:56:44.944 --> 00:56:46.502
l want to spend time with you.


00:56:46.579 --> 00:56:50.116
l want a relationship.
Not a retirement plan.


00:56:50.116 --> 00:56:51.606
Please, Rohini.


00:56:52.285 --> 00:56:54.787
The chairman of Nakatomi Corporation
wants a meeting with me.


00:56:54.787 --> 00:56:56.516
What do l do?
l have to go.


00:56:58.090 --> 00:57:01.787
lf the presentation does it,
he'll give us the entire account.


00:57:01.861 --> 00:57:04.230
That will boost my career.


00:57:04.230 --> 00:57:05.788
Can't you see that?


00:57:05.865 --> 00:57:07.025
What about our deal?


00:57:08.134 --> 00:57:10.762
We can go next month.


00:57:11.737 --> 00:57:13.466
lt's my birthday, Arjun.


00:57:14.473 --> 00:57:17.442
- l know.
- lt won't come next month.


00:57:18.311 --> 00:57:22.577
You had promised that we would
go to ltaly no matter what.


00:57:23.282 --> 00:57:25.750
And you cancelled the tickets
without even talking to me.


00:57:28.354 --> 00:57:30.481
Rohini, l really am sorry.


00:57:31.457 --> 00:57:33.584
Please understand. Just a second.


00:57:34.861 --> 00:57:37.887
lt's an important call.
Just one second.


00:57:38.130 --> 00:57:39.597
Rohini, one second.
Hello...


00:57:42.068 --> 00:57:43.092
Yes, Alex...


00:57:44.203 --> 00:57:46.398
l'll be there in ten minutes.


00:58:10.229 --> 00:58:13.399
Hey babe, l guess you're on the plane.


00:58:13.399 --> 00:58:18.271
l called to say that we're going to
Bunol tomorrow, for the Tomatina festiva


00:58:18.271 --> 00:58:20.262
Laila is taking us.


00:58:20.973 --> 00:58:22.463
Please don't be upset.


00:58:24.310 --> 00:58:27.905
Please call when you get this message.
l love you.


00:58:33.519 --> 00:58:34.713
Where the hell is he?


00:58:42.795 --> 00:58:45.127
Oh - my - God!


00:58:51.604 --> 00:58:55.301
- l love it.
- Unbelievable!


00:58:55.374 --> 00:58:57.399
- Okay.
- Yes?


00:58:58.210 --> 00:58:59.438
- Can l drive?
- No.


00:59:00.446 --> 00:59:01.378
Kabira...


00:59:02.014 --> 00:59:05.251
if four days of diving
can do this to you.


00:59:05.251 --> 00:59:07.947
Trust me, you should stay under water.


00:59:08.220 --> 00:59:11.090
Who knows if l'll be with you guys again...


00:59:11.090 --> 00:59:13.292
l decided, it's all or bust!


00:59:13.292 --> 00:59:14.953
- Right?
- Correct.


00:59:15.027 --> 00:59:17.129
Dude, you're getting married.


00:59:17.129 --> 00:59:19.324
You're not going to prison.


00:59:19.398 --> 00:59:20.456
Thanks.


00:59:21.400 --> 00:59:22.424
All set?


00:59:22.702 --> 00:59:23.726
- Arjun...


00:59:24.103 --> 00:59:25.161
can you help me?


00:59:25.571 --> 00:59:27.974
- lt's to the right.
- lt's jammed, what did you do?


00:59:27.974 --> 00:59:28.702
Dude!


00:59:30.576 --> 00:59:32.100
You have to apply some force.


00:59:42.388 --> 00:59:43.355
- Hi.
- Hello.


00:59:45.358 --> 00:59:46.325
Child!


00:59:47.059 --> 00:59:48.227
Relax in the front seat.


00:59:48.227 --> 00:59:49.785
Driver... Bunol.


00:59:50.529 --> 00:59:53.430
So Lailaji, hale and hearty
both packed in the bag?


01:00:00.039 --> 01:00:01.006
No, thanks.


01:00:16.455 --> 01:00:18.013
What are you doing?


01:00:18.624 --> 01:00:22.025
Laila, meet Bagwati.


01:00:25.264 --> 01:00:26.754
Hi Bagwati.


01:00:30.036 --> 01:00:31.936
Bagwatithinks you are very beautiful.


01:00:32.705 --> 01:00:34.036
Thank you, Bagwati.


