01:21:22.694 --> 01:21:25.185
And if you and Sameera
ever decide to go on a trip...


01:21:25.964 --> 01:21:27.158
why would I stop you?


01:21:27.365 --> 01:21:30.602
And if I told you
that weve met some guys...


01:21:30.602 --> 01:21:32.934
and made dinner plans
with them, then?


01:21:33.438 --> 01:21:34.302
Then what?


01:21:34.773 --> 01:21:35.603
Then what?


01:21:36.207 --> 01:21:38.143
I trust you.


01:21:38.143 --> 01:21:41.271
Of course Id want
you both to be safe...


01:21:41.946 --> 01:21:43.345
but besides that,
I wont suspect you.


01:21:43.415 --> 01:21:45.747
Im sorry, but its easier said than done.


01:21:47.919 --> 01:21:48.578
Babe...


01:21:50.422 --> 01:21:52.117
youre welcome to stay
if you want to.


01:21:52.190 --> 01:21:54.920
But if you don't,
III drive you to the airport tomorrow.


01:21:58.096 --> 01:21:58.994
Good night.


01:22:11.076 --> 01:22:13.237
- III miss you.
- Take care.


01:22:14.279 --> 01:22:16.179
Stay in touch. See at the wedding.


01:22:16.247 --> 01:22:17.805
- Imran, can you help me?
- Of course.


01:22:17.882 --> 01:22:19.084
For sure. Okay?


01:22:19.085 --> 01:22:20.785
- Email me.
- I will.


01:22:20.785 --> 01:22:21.615
Good luck.


01:22:24.756 --> 01:22:25.814
Hey...


01:22:30.962 --> 01:22:32.657
Yesterday was...


01:22:36.735 --> 01:22:38.225
I had the best time yesterday.


01:22:39.804 --> 01:22:40.930
Me too.


01:22:42.807 --> 01:22:44.642
And good luck...


01:22:44.642 --> 01:22:46.940
for your upcoming adventures.


01:22:49.047 --> 01:22:50.275
Thanks.


01:23:05.063 --> 01:23:06.030
III see you.


01:23:09.300 --> 01:23:09.959
Bye.


01:23:13.772 --> 01:23:14.739
Bye.


01:23:15.206 --> 01:23:16.070
Ciao.


01:23:40.098 --> 01:23:42.967
<i>A thought came alive, but away it hid.</i>


01:23:42.967 --> 01:23:45.697
<i>It stole a glance, from under the eyelids.</i>


01:23:45.770 --> 01:23:50.002
<i>Sometimes from you, sometimes from me</i>
it asked for words to set it free.


01:23:52.744 --> 01:23:56.114
<i>Words to wear, so from
the lips it can flee.</i>


01:23:56.114 --> 01:23:59.675
<i>A voice it can embrace and sway with glee.</i>


01:24:00.852 --> 01:24:04.686
<i>But this thought</i>
Is a feeling... just a feeling.


01:24:08.193 --> 01:24:10.491
<i>Like a fragrance floating in the breeze.</i>


01:24:11.196 --> 01:24:13.494
<i>A fragrance that is unspeaking.</i>


01:24:14.265 --> 01:24:16.935
<i>You live with it.</i>


01:24:16.935 --> 01:24:18.994
<i>I'm aware of it.</i>


01:24:19.637 --> 01:24:21.628
<i>Out in the open for the world to see.</i>


01:24:21.706 --> 01:24:23.936
<i>What is this unknown mystery?</i>


01:26:09.013 --> 01:26:10.002
Laila?


01:26:18.456 --> 01:26:19.753
Youll forgot something?


01:26:40.445 --> 01:26:42.174
I hate regrets.


01:26:44.849 --> 01:26:46.316
Then you shouldn't have any.


01:27:04.369 --> 01:27:05.358
Bye.


01:27:24.856 --> 01:27:29.093
<i>Flying away in the open sky...</i>


01:27:29.093 --> 01:27:33.393
<i>Are the birds of my dreams.</i>


01:27:36.134 --> 01:27:38.967
<i>Flying away...</i>


01:27:39.704 --> 01:27:44.403
<i>To the land of my heart</i>
are the birds of my dreams.


01:27:49.580 --> 01:27:54.950
<i>Don't know where they'll go next.</i>


01:27:58.022 --> 01:28:03.153
<i>Wings have taken flight and</i>
now says my sight you've finally awoken.


01:28:03.628 --> 01:28:08.827
<i>What was on your mind is left behind</i>
You've moved far ahead in time.


01:28:09.801 --> 01:28:14.795
<i>Life is floating on a breeze.</i>


01:28:15.473 --> 01:28:20.342
<i>Life is telling you and me.</i>


01:28:23.781 --> 01:28:28.150
<i>Now whatever will be will be.</i>


01:29:05.790 --> 01:29:11.160
<i>A touch from someone</i>
and I've been wandering without a thought.


01:29:11.462 --> 01:29:17.635
<i>Somewhere new words were spoken</i>
and since then I've been lost.


01:29:17.635 --> 01:29:22.663
<i>Something made the heart melt.</i>


01:29:23.374 --> 01:29:28.175
<i>In a blink, I was someone else.</i>


01:29:31.582 --> 01:29:35.780
<i>Now whatever will be will be.</i>


01:29:45.263 --> 01:29:53.671
<i>A light shone down</i> Now there's a
beauty being showered on the streets.


01:29:56.607 --> 01:30:05.140
<i>Happiness came down</i>
Now there's a zest being showered upon me.


01:30:06.517 --> 01:30:12.820
<i>Now I finally know who I was meant to be.</i>


01:30:16.260 --> 01:30:21.994
<i>Do you remember that moment yesterday</i>
The one with the magic force?


01:30:22.066 --> 01:30:28.130
<i>It transformed us into something new</i>
I wonder which moment it was?


01:30:28.206 --> 01:30:32.040
<i>The heart says just blindly go to.</i>


01:30:33.845 --> 01:30:38.578
<i>Any place that desire takes you.</i>


01:30:42.186 --> 01:30:48.182
<i>Now whatever will be will be.</i>


01:31:19.390 --> 01:31:19.488
What do you mean,
youve quit your job?


01:31:19.489 --> 01:31:21.225
What do you mean,
youve quit your job?


01:31:21.226 --> 01:31:22.460
Meaning?


01:31:22.460 --> 01:31:24.621
Were getting married in two months.


01:31:24.695 --> 01:31:26.925
So? You can resume after the wedding.


01:31:27.899 --> 01:31:28.923
How?


01:31:29.400 --> 01:31:30.958
First, well go on the honeymoon...


01:31:31.035 --> 01:31:33.638
then I want to redo the house.


01:31:33.638 --> 01:31:35.833
That will take about a year.


01:31:36.407 --> 01:31:38.976
And if youre going
to Singapore for your new project...


01:31:38.976 --> 01:31:40.807
