01:31:43.347 --> 01:31:44.382
But...


01:31:44.382 --> 01:31:46.714
that hotel is your dream project, Natasha.


01:31:47.051 --> 01:31:48.575
Dreams change baby.


01:31:49.520 --> 01:31:52.590
Then, I didn't know Id be getting married.


01:31:52.590 --> 01:31:53.557
Married?


01:31:54.792 --> 01:31:56.623
What does marriage have to do with it?


01:31:56.861 --> 01:31:58.629
What do you mean?


01:31:58.629 --> 01:32:00.256
Obviously, priorities change.


01:32:01.098 --> 01:32:04.625
After the wedding, even you wouldnt
want to go on this kind of boys holiday.


01:32:16.881 --> 01:32:19.042
- When is her flight?
- At 6 p.m.


01:32:21.886 --> 01:32:24.252
Dont worry man, well make it.


01:32:25.423 --> 01:32:26.253
Yeah.


01:32:32.029 --> 01:32:33.155
Very funny!


01:32:36.300 --> 01:32:37.130
All okay, babe?


01:32:37.735 --> 01:32:38.463
Yeah.


01:32:39.236 --> 01:32:40.430
Can I drive?


01:32:43.441 --> 01:32:45.170
Can you drive?


01:32:52.850 --> 01:32:56.387
Babe, the speed limit is 120.
You can go faster.


01:32:56.387 --> 01:32:58.548
Yes, we may just miss that flight.


01:32:59.290 --> 01:33:01.190
Im not going to drive rashly.


01:33:01.592 --> 01:33:02.752
Watch out!


01:33:04.729 --> 01:33:06.856
Please keep your eyes on the road, please!


01:33:07.431 --> 01:33:09.433
Then tell him not to talk to me.


01:33:09.433 --> 01:33:10.764
Dont talk to her.


01:33:15.940 --> 01:33:17.100
I love this song.


01:33:20.745 --> 01:33:24.272
Rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:27.351 --> 01:33:31.344
Im a rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:34.525 --> 01:33:38.552
Nothing rocks better than
a rock chick girl...


01:33:41.365 --> 01:33:45.665
Im a rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:49.807 --> 01:33:50.967
I had fun.


01:33:54.412 --> 01:33:55.276
Listen...


01:33:59.016 --> 01:34:00.040
Im sorry.


01:34:01.552 --> 01:34:02.416
Me too.


01:34:03.187 --> 01:34:04.415
Bye <i>Bagwati</i>.


01:34:15.299 --> 01:34:16.129
Tell me...


01:34:16.801 --> 01:34:18.701
what do you think about them?


01:34:22.106 --> 01:34:24.631
- Kabir is not himself when Natasha is around.
- Thats what I thought.


01:34:25.276 --> 01:34:26.140
Correct.


01:34:27.912 --> 01:34:29.277
I sense some tension.


01:34:31.215 --> 01:34:32.113
Did you speak with him?


01:34:34.051 --> 01:34:34.745
Why should I?


01:34:35.553 --> 01:34:38.181
If a friend doesn't address
a personal problem, then who will?


01:34:39.857 --> 01:34:41.258
Forget it man!


01:34:41.258 --> 01:34:43.590
Theyll sort their problem
and well get screwed in the middle.


01:34:43.727 --> 01:34:44.591
<i>Chee</i>, man!


01:34:45.362 --> 01:34:47.064
You are seriously shameless.


01:34:47.064 --> 01:34:47.928
What?


01:34:49.767 --> 01:34:52.136
Look... he is our friend.


01:34:52.136 --> 01:34:54.036
When he is back,
lets talk to him.


01:34:56.307 --> 01:34:57.103
Okay?


01:34:59.043 --> 01:34:59.600
Okay.


01:35:22.066 --> 01:35:22.794
God!


01:35:23.534 --> 01:35:24.592
Now what has he done?


01:35:25.703 --> 01:35:28.763
Hes buried inside his diary again.
Hes too boring.


01:35:29.206 --> 01:35:30.833
What do you write in it?


01:35:31.475 --> 01:35:32.271
Its private.


01:35:33.277 --> 01:35:34.209
Rascal...


01:35:34.879 --> 01:35:36.176
youve always been secretive.


01:35:36.547 --> 01:35:39.550
- But theres nothing to tell.
- No, no, no!


01:35:39.550 --> 01:35:41.780
Youre obviously struggling
with an emotional problem.


01:35:42.887 --> 01:35:44.616
What? Me?


01:35:44.688 --> 01:35:45.855
Arjun...


01:35:45.856 --> 01:35:47.725
I truly believe that...


01:35:47.725 --> 01:35:51.718
if a friend doesn't address
a personal problem, then who will?


01:35:52.897 --> 01:35:54.932
- Continue.
- Yes, absolutely.


01:35:54.932 --> 01:35:57.332
To figure out the problem
we have to do a test.


01:35:57.401 --> 01:35:59.236
- III say a word.
- Okay.


01:35:59.236 --> 01:36:03.297
And you have to say the first thing
that comes to your mind.


01:36:03.374 --> 01:36:04.975
Without deliberating.


01:36:04.975 --> 01:36:06.340
- Alright?
- Okay.


01:36:06.410 --> 01:36:08.071
- Ready, doctor.
- Fine.


01:36:08.512 --> 01:36:09.479
Car.


01:36:09.713 --> 01:36:10.614
Road.


01:36:10.614 --> 01:36:11.581
Arjun.


01:36:11.882 --> 01:36:12.746
Brother.


01:36:12.917 --> 01:36:13.781
Diary.


01:36:13.851 --> 01:36:14.684
Poetry.


01:36:14.685 --> 01:36:15.553
Heart.


01:36:15.553 --> 01:36:16.110
Love.


01:36:16.187 --> 01:36:17.054
Mumbai.


01:36:17.054 --> 01:36:17.922
Traffic.


01:36:17.923 --> 01:36:18.980
Father.


01:36:20.791 --> 01:36:21.758
- Father?
- Mother.


01:36:24.929 --> 01:36:26.988
According to my test...


01:36:27.064 --> 01:36:29.967
your father is the root of
your emotional problem.


01:36:29.967 --> 01:36:31.525
And youre keeping this from the world.


01:36:33.204 --> 01:36:36.473
And, in my opinion,
Dr. Sigmund <i>Fraud</i>...


01:36:36.473 --> 01:36:40.170
its time to shred your degree.
Please stop practicing, please!


01:36:40.444 --> 01:36:41.934
You hurt my feelings, man.


01:36:53.390 --> 01:36:54.186
My <i>bwoys</i>!


01:36:55.125 --> 01:36:57.685
If you want a view,
look that way.


01:37:06.637 --> 01:37:08.298
We should talk to him.


01:37:15.112 --> 01:37:18.449
Natasha is really sweet.
It was really nice to meet her.


01:37:18.449 --> 01:37:22.078
Yeah... even she was glad
to have met you.


01:37:25.122 --> 01:37:26.316
Kabir...


01:37:28.792 --> 01:37:31.192
- are you happy?
- Yes.


01:37:35.399 --> 01:37:38.232
Why... are you asking like this?


01:37:41.272 --> 01:37:43.467
I don't know man. Listen...


01:37:44.241 --> 01:37:46.402
its possible I may be wrong.


01:37:47.611 --> 01:37:51.308
But, we are friends.
And I just...


01:37:51.382 --> 01:37:52.508
I just have to ask you.


01:37:54.585 --> 01:37:57.554
Are you happy with Natasha?


01:37:58.789 --> 01:38:02.987
Dude, you just met her.
And the poor girl was a bit tense.


01:38:03.761 --> 01:38:06.321
She thought there was something
between Laila and me.


01:38:08.065 --> 01:38:08.963
Yeah.


01:38:09.700 --> 01:38:12.726
But, now theres no problem.
Thanks to you, my <i>bwoys</i>!


01:38:13.804 --> 01:38:15.032
Okay?


01:38:15.105 --> 01:38:16.299
Shes sweet.


01:38:16.807 --> 01:38:18.468
Imran, youve met her.
You spent time with her.


01:38:18.542 --> 01:38:19.406
Tell him.


01:38:19.810 --> 01:38:21.107
Yes, she is very sweet.


01:38:25.215 --> 01:38:26.448
Well thats good, man.


01:38:26.449 --> 01:38:27.280
Im happy for you.


01:38:33.057 --> 01:38:34.581
Hey... heres an extra pillow!


01:38:39.763 --> 01:38:40.923
Good night, <i>bwoys</i>.


01:38:42.132 --> 01:38:43.292
Good night.


01:38:58.115 --> 01:39:01.642
Guys, do you mind
if we take a detour?


01:39:02.686 --> 01:39:03.482
Why?


01:39:03.921 --> 01:39:05.752
There is an artist, Salman Habib.


01:39:05.923 --> 01:39:09.093
He lives around here.
The lady at the gallery told me.


01:39:09.093 --> 01:39:11.152
That he sells his paintings from home.


01:39:11.862 --> 01:39:12.829
Really?


01:39:13.931 --> 01:39:14.829
Sounds good.


01:39:14.898 --> 01:39:17.196
Anyway, Im a bit bored
hanging with just the two of you.


01:39:34.551 --> 01:39:38.112
The map says we should take
the next right for Grazalema.


01:39:38.355 --> 01:39:39.857
Salman Habib.


01:39:39.857 --> 01:39:41.984
Youll find Indians in
every corner of the world.


01:39:42.726 --> 01:39:44.751
Really, man. Were everywhere!


01:39:46.063 --> 01:39:47.860
Grazalema. Turn right over here.


01:39:55.973 --> 01:39:59.500
