- Forget it.


01:39:59.576 --> 01:40:03.113
Dont feel like it.
Lets go to Seville.


01:40:03.113 --> 01:40:05.513
- Are you sure?
- Yeah.


01:40:05.582 --> 01:40:07.550
We can go on the way back.
Its okay.


01:40:08.852 --> 01:40:09.819
Okay!


01:40:10.954 --> 01:40:14.822
Its time to see
what Ive planned for us.


01:40:20.264 --> 01:40:22.232
Check it out, <i>bwoys</i>!


01:40:23.634 --> 01:40:25.932
Look at that guys!


01:40:27.104 --> 01:40:30.005
- Arjun, my pal. You rock!
- Look at that dude!


01:40:30.073 --> 01:40:31.631
- Wow!
- You b******!


01:40:32.242 --> 01:40:33.876
Youre purposely doing this.


01:40:33.877 --> 01:40:35.579
