01:40:35.579 --> 01:40:36.807
Dont be silly.


01:40:37.414 --> 01:40:38.938
I want to do this.
Its my dream.


01:40:39.016 --> 01:40:40.643
- Yeah right!
- Just imagine...


01:40:41.418 --> 01:40:44.546
jumping from 15,000 feet
and flying towards the earth.


01:40:45.022 --> 01:40:46.649
Thats not flying, thats falling.


01:40:47.591 --> 01:40:48.558
It will be fun.


01:40:48.959 --> 01:40:49.948
Relax.


01:40:50.027 --> 01:40:52.029
Remember he eventually enjoyed diving.


01:40:52.029 --> 01:40:52.761
- Correct.
- Big deal.


01:40:52.762 --> 01:40:55.129
With a beautiful instructor
like Laila, who wouldnt!


01:40:55.766 --> 01:40:57.631
You never know,
you also might get lucky.


01:40:58.035 --> 01:41:01.371
You people ready to
jump out of a plane?


01:41:01.371 --> 01:41:02.360
Oh yeah!


01:41:02.606 --> 01:41:05.166
Are you ready to enter the air?


01:41:05.542 --> 01:41:06.531
Yeah!


01:41:09.880 --> 01:41:12.282
Head up. Eyes to the horizon.


01:41:12.282 --> 01:41:14.011
Legs at 45 degrees.


01:41:14.585 --> 01:41:16.815
Arch! Arch!


01:41:20.624 --> 01:41:22.023
- Did I say relax?
- No.


01:41:22.593 --> 01:41:26.120
I said arch. I didn't say relax.


01:41:38.208 --> 01:41:39.732
These are total malfunctions.


01:41:40.244 --> 01:41:43.213
In case of a total malfunction
what you have to do is this.


01:41:43.213 --> 01:41:45.374
Cut away your main and
deploy your reserve.


01:41:45.849 --> 01:41:47.476
What is that?
You have a malfunction.


01:41:50.354 --> 01:41:52.589
Cut away my main and
deploy my reserve.


01:41:52.589 --> 01:41:53.920
What are you doing?


01:41:54.758 --> 01:41:57.283
- Its a broken line.
- Are you sure its a broken line?


01:41:58.195 --> 01:42:01.358
Scissor kick... scissor kick...


01:42:02.132 --> 01:42:03.360
Cut! Deploy!


01:42:04.368 --> 01:42:05.232
Perfect!


01:42:10.274 --> 01:42:10.933
Whats this?


01:42:11.375 --> 01:42:12.307
Waiver form.


01:42:12.308 --> 01:42:13.037
Waiver form?


01:42:13.110 --> 01:42:16.443
If something happens to us... like death,
these guys arent responsible.


01:42:16.513 --> 01:42:18.081
We are responsible for it.


01:42:18.081 --> 01:42:18.809
What?


01:42:22.586 --> 01:42:23.610
