01:43:59.216 --> 01:44:00.376
Adios amigo!


01:44:02.452 --> 01:44:03.646
See you downstairs!


01:44:17.734 --> 01:44:18.723
Let go, Imran.


01:44:20.937 --> 01:44:22.632
Just let it all go!


01:44:52.369 --> 01:44:53.768
Push me!


01:45:50.026 --> 01:45:51.391
Come on, Imran!


01:45:54.431 --> 01:45:55.557
Imran!


01:48:18.742 --> 01:48:22.269
<i>Who are you?</i>
Where have you been?


01:48:22.913 --> 01:48:25.473
<i>I've moved the heaven and the earth</i>
but I couldn't flnd you.


01:48:26.716 --> 01:48:30.049
<i>But you arrive today</i>,
so suddenly.


01:48:30.620 --> 01:48:33.646
<i>And you give meaning to</i>
my whole life with your love.


01:48:34.357 --> 01:48:35.984
<i>I don't understand.</i>


01:48:36.526 --> 01:48:38.187
<i>I don't know.</i>


01:48:38.561 --> 01:48:41.428
<i>What you've said to me, SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:48:42.132 --> 01:48:45.590
<i>Even then, I have no idea why.</i>


01:48:46.369 --> 01:48:49.566
<i>I like what I heard, SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:49:00.083 --> 01:49:02.415
<i>Don't look away.</i>


01:49:04.120 --> 01:49:06.281
<i>Stay close to me.</i>


01:49:07.958 --> 01:49:10.518
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:49:11.094 --> 01:49:13.790
