01:49:34.250 --> 01:49:37.378
<i>I will never understand.</i>


01:49:38.421 --> 01:49:41.481
<i>The meaning of the words</i>
you dedicate to me.


01:49:42.025 --> 01:49:44.994
<i>But the warmth of your gaze.</i>


01:49:46.229 --> 01:49:49.460
<i>Makes me feel like</i>
the most beautiful SeÃ±orita.


01:49:49.866 --> 01:49:54.104
