01:50:33.710 --> 01:50:36.079
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:50:36.079 --> 01:50:40.448
<i>SeÃ±orita, listen to us</i>
SeÃ±orita, d'you hear what we're saying.


01:50:48.892 --> 01:50:51.383
<i>With every moment that has passed.</i>


01:50:53.396 --> 01:50:55.591
<i>Oh SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:50:57.300 --> 01:51:00.133
