01:51:00.537 --> 01:51:02.402
<i>And that's all there is to it.</i>


01:51:03.106 --> 01:51:05.131
<i>Don't look away.</i>


01:51:07.043 --> 01:51:09.204
<i>Stay close to me.</i>


01:51:10.747 --> 01:51:13.113
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


