<i>Hope you've understood SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:51:17.554 --> 01:51:20.580
<i>Even a few moments of love.</i>


01:51:22.459 --> 01:51:24.484
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:51:25.361 --> 01:51:28.888
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:51:30.266 --> 01:51:32.598
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:52:12.075 --> 01:52:14.839
Remember before cable TV
we only had one national channel?


01:52:17.080 --> 01:52:19.605
And every Sunday
they showed a Hindi film.


01:52:21.017 --> 01:52:22.644
Get to the point.


01:52:24.120 --> 01:52:25.144
The point is...


01:52:26.022 --> 01:52:28.081
before the film there was this animation.


01:52:29.125 --> 01:52:31.616
A white circle went round and round
and formed the channel logo.


01:52:34.230 --> 01:52:35.424
Do you remember the tune?


01:52:55.618 --> 01:52:56.448
Brilliant!


01:53:08.198 --> 01:53:10.496
That tune never failed to depress me.


01:53:11.568 --> 01:53:12.557
Depressed.


01:53:14.304 --> 01:53:15.999
Im feeling the same right now.


01:53:19.142 --> 01:53:21.235
Weekends over and school begins.


01:53:21.678 --> 01:53:24.614
- And you wanted to cancel this trip!
- I know, man!


01:53:24.614 --> 01:53:25.842
Can you imagine?


01:53:29.852 --> 01:53:30.978
You know what that means?


01:53:32.455 --> 01:53:33.683
It means...


01:53:34.857 --> 01:53:37.018
that everything is predestined.


01:53:39.696 --> 01:53:40.754
Everything!


01:53:41.864 --> 01:53:45.322
This holiday was in our destiny.


01:53:46.536 --> 01:53:47.503
You know!


01:53:50.306 --> 01:53:52.103
You, me and asshole.


01:53:53.409 --> 01:53:55.070
- Cheers asshole.
- Wheres asshole?


01:53:57.213 --> 01:53:57.736
Cheers!


01:54:00.617 --> 01:54:02.107
Laila too.


01:54:06.189 --> 01:54:08.316
I was meant to meet her.


01:54:09.626 --> 01:54:10.991
You are in <i>louw</i>, my <i>bwoy</i>.


01:54:11.794 --> 01:54:12.920
No, man!


01:54:13.429 --> 01:54:14.794
You are in louw...


01:54:15.531 --> 01:54:16.799
You are in louw...


01:54:16.800 --> 01:54:19.666
- You are in <i>louw...</i>
- Kabir, man!


01:54:19.736 --> 01:54:22.102
Everything is written.
Listen to me.


01:54:22.305 --> 01:54:23.795
Its all predestined.


01:54:24.040 --> 01:54:24.874
You know what Im saying?


01:54:24.875 --> 01:54:27.042
This moment... us right now...


01:54:27.043 --> 01:54:28.511
its predestined.


01:54:28.511 --> 01:54:30.069
Predestined.


01:54:30.847 --> 01:54:32.872
Please stop saying, predestined...!


01:54:33.182 --> 01:54:34.706
I beg of you!


01:54:35.184 --> 01:54:37.719
This too is predestined.
Its all written.


01:54:37.720 --> 01:54:39.722
Alright, we get it.


01:54:39.722 --> 01:54:41.622
Listen, we get it, zip!


01:54:41.691 --> 01:54:42.851
Come on, man!


01:54:44.560 --> 01:54:45.527
Its true.


01:54:46.629 --> 01:54:47.797
Its predestined...


01:54:47.798 --> 01:54:48.695
Guys...


01:55:00.376 --> 01:55:01.240
Hola...


01:55:13.690 --> 01:55:15.180
Guys, watch out!


01:55:17.960 --> 01:55:19.018
What the hell, guys?


01:55:25.902 --> 01:55:26.698
Yes?


01:55:42.251 --> 01:55:45.121
- Our man is back.
- Their mobiles are switched off.


01:55:45.121 --> 01:55:46.110
- What?
- Yup.


01:55:46.189 --> 01:55:47.290
Even Nurias?


01:55:47.290 --> 01:55:48.848
Yes, Im shocked.


01:55:48.925 --> 01:55:51.985
When she knew wed land up in jail,
she shouldve kept the phone switched on.


01:55:53.363 --> 01:55:55.365
If our bail isnt posted...


01:55:55.365 --> 01:55:57.890
well be stuck here for days.


01:56:02.538 --> 01:56:03.402
Arjun...


01:56:05.074 --> 01:56:06.871
tell them I want to make a call.


01:56:07.910 --> 01:56:09.036
To whom?


01:56:10.113 --> 01:56:11.341
Salman Habib.


01:56:11.848 --> 01:56:12.872
The artist?


01:56:14.717 --> 01:56:15.411
Yeah.


01:56:16.786 --> 01:56:18.583
Why will he come to post our bail?


01:56:20.356 --> 01:56:21.516
Are you alright?


01:56:22.392 --> 01:56:24.794
Just because we cant reach anyone,
hes losing it.


01:56:24.795 --> 01:56:25.852
Hes my father.


01:56:26.729 --> 01:56:27.423
What?


01:56:29.899 --> 01:56:31.025
I am his son.


01:56:41.377 --> 01:56:42.571
Just let it go Imran.


01:56:45.248 --> 01:56:46.306
Just let it go.


01:56:46.883 --> 01:56:47.542
Hello...


01:56:48.918 --> 01:56:50.286
Hello, may I...


01:56:50.286 --> 01:56:52.447
speak with Mr. Salman Habib, please?


01:56:53.189 --> 01:56:53.917
Yes?


01:56:55.558 --> 01:56:57.287
Sir, I am Imran.


01:56:59.228 --> 01:57:01.719
I am Rahilas son.


01:57:06.035 --> 01:57:07.502
When did you find out?


01:57:10.807 --> 01:57:12.707
Afew days after Abu died.


01:57:15.511 --> 01:57:18.969
In his stuff, I found a letter
that Ammi had written to him.


01:57:20.416 --> 01:57:22.145
The letter stated that...


01:57:22.218 --> 01:57:27.918
Ammi was grateful that Abu had
accepted her and her unborn child.


01:57:31.260 --> 01:57:32.818
Why didn't you tell us?


01:57:35.865 --> 01:57:37.196
I was a bit shaken up.


01:57:38.935 --> 01:57:41.460
What would I tell you?
<i>Abu is not my father.</i>


01:57:44.106 --> 01:57:46.074
He loved you a lot.


01:57:47.610 --> 01:57:49.237
He really loved you.


01:57:51.180 --> 01:57:52.511
And us.


01:57:53.216 --> 01:57:55.217
I mean, think about it.


01:57:55.218 --> 01:57:57.753
Be it sports day or
parent-teacher meetings...


01:57:57.753 --> 01:58:01.086
our fathers seldom came,
but Abu was always there.


01:58:02.725 --> 01:58:04.920
Well, my father was dead.


01:58:05.428 --> 01:58:08.761
So, if he showed up for sports day
it wouldve been a bit strange.


01:58:15.705 --> 01:58:17.104
Youve got bail.


01:58:20.376 --> 01:58:21.673
Theyre here.


01:58:33.389 --> 01:58:34.253
Hi.


01:58:37.293 --> 01:58:38.089
Imran.


01:58:40.296 --> 01:58:41.263
Imran...


01:58:42.532 --> 01:58:43.396
Im Salman.


01:58:48.070 --> 01:58:50.139
My friends, Arjun and Kabir.


01:58:50.139 --> 01:58:51.333
- Hello.
- Thank you.


01:58:51.407 --> 01:58:52.704
Hi... thank you.


01:58:53.643 --> 01:58:55.634
You three look pretty hungover.


01:58:58.948 --> 01:59:01.746
Youre welcome to come over to
my place and freshen up.


01:59:02.418 --> 01:59:05.148
Our bags and car are at the hotel.


01:59:05.354 --> 01:59:06.753
III drive you there.


01:59:08.591 --> 01:59:09.285
Come.


01:59:24.273 --> 01:59:26.298
Wow, this is beautiful.


01:59:28.044 --> 01:59:29.068
Its really nice.


01:59:30.279 --> 01:59:32.474
Are you always so polite?


01:59:33.950 --> 01:59:37.249
Its absolute rubbish.
Anyone can do that.


01:59:38.054 --> 01:59:40.555
This gentleman, my neighbour...


01:59:40.556 --> 01:59:43.759
was obsessed with having his wife
immortalised in a potrait.


01:59:43.759 --> 01:59:47.286
So, I applied my brush
and fulfilled his desire.


01:59:47.363 --> 01:59:49.695
And with his money, paid my bills.


01:59:52.068 --> 01:59:54.400
So, what are you guys doing in Seville?


01:59:55.104 --> 01:59:56.472
Skydiving.


01:59:56.472 --> 01:59:57.632
- Really?
- Yeah.


01:59:57.707 --> 01:59:59.834
So, you jumped out of a plane
and landed in jail?


02:00:01.110 --> 02:00:02.475
You could say that.


02:00:02.945 --> 02:00:07.075
That apart, what do you do?


02:00:08.050 --> 02:00:09.677
Well, Im a financial broker.


02:00:10.052 --> 02:00:11.019
In London.


02:00:11.520 --> 02:00:12.578
Money man.


02:00:14.023 --> 02:00:14.751
And you?


02:00:15.391 --> 02:00:17.086
My family is in the construction business.


02:00:18.127 --> 02:00:20.493
Well, never mind.
Everyone makes mistakes.


02:00:21.464 --> 02:00:22.260
Thats funny.


02:00:22.898 --> 02:00:24.889
Youre a Xerox copy of him.


02:00:28.604 --> 02:00:30.299
And, what about you?


02:00:31.707 --> 02:00:32.605
I write.


02:00:34.276 --> 02:00:34.833
What?


02:00:35.711 --> 02:00:37.440
Im a copywriter in advertising.


02:00:38.514 --> 02:00:41.574
Writing copy for ads is like
a buffet for the masses.


02:00:41.951 --> 02:00:44.647
For instance, this painting is
for someone else.


02:00:46.088 --> 02:00:48.886
Do you write anything
to feed your own soul?


02:00:50.593 --> 02:00:51.924
I do.


02:00:56.732 --> 02:00:57.532
Sir?


02:00:57.600 --> 02:00:58.430
Salman.


02:00:59.135 --> 02:01:00.864
Right. Well be outside.


02:01:18.354 --> 02:01:21.517
Your hands are very similar to mine.


02:01:24.927 --> 02:01:25.894
Sit.


02:01:29.632 --> 02:01:30.530
Do you live alone?


02:01:31.033 --> 02:01:32.000
No.


02:01:32.702 --> 02:01:33.566
I have a wife.


02:01:33.936 --> 02:01:36.063
But she is away... in Paris.


02:01:36.572 --> 02:01:37.266
Sit.


02:01:40.376 --> 02:01:41.308
And any...


02:01:41.544 --> 02:01:42.704
children?


02:01:49.285 --> 02:01:50.513
Do you ever come to India?


02:01:51.554 --> 02:01:52.621
Yes.


02:01:52.621 --> 02:01:55.488
I was there four years ago
when my mother passed away.


02:01:56.859 --> 02:01:58.561
- Sorry.
- I have a brother there...


02:01:58.562 --> 02:01:59.528
but...


02:02:01.130 --> 02:02:02.427
we don't meet.


02:02:08.037 --> 02:02:10.403
Ive often thought about you.


02:02:12.374 --> 02:02:13.398
I mean...


02:02:14.877 --> 02:02:19.337
that someday, somewhere we might meet.


02:02:21.016 --> 02:02:23.452
But I never figured...


02:02:23.452 --> 02:02:26.012
what I would say to you.


02:02:27.690 --> 02:02:28.850
Just say the truth.


02:02:31.627 --> 02:02:33.822
The truth... what is the truth?


02:02:35.064 --> 02:02:37.624
Everyone has their own version.


02:02:42.972 --> 02:02:45.141
Look... I was...


02:02:45.141 --> 02:02:47.006
25 then.


02:02:48.177 --> 02:02:51.146
Rahila was a few years younger.


02:02:52.548 --> 02:02:55.284
When youre young
the future doesn't matter.


02:02:55.284 --> 02:02:56.911
We were just kids.


02:02:59.555 --> 02:03:01.614
One day...


02:03:01.690 --> 02:03:04.181
Rahila told me that shes...


02:03:04.794 --> 02:03:07.661
expecting a baby.


02:03:07.730 --> 02:03:10.631
I wasnt ready for
the responsibility then.


02:03:10.699 --> 02:03:12.599
And nor am I now.


02:03:19.108 --> 02:03:22.043
So... you just abandoned her?


02:03:25.915 --> 02:03:28.907
I guess, you could say that.


02:03:34.089 --> 02:03:38.617
Rahila wanted a family,
she wanted to be a mother.


02:03:39.929 --> 02:03:42.557
I had other dreams.
I wanted to be an artist.


02:03:43.566 --> 02:03:45.568
I wanted to paint...


02:03:45.568 --> 02:03:47.035
travel the world.


02:03:48.571 --> 02:03:50.973
I loved her but...


02:03:50.973 --> 02:03:53.999
she made her choice
and I made mine.


02:03:54.076 --> 02:03:55.873
Thats all.


02:03:59.782 --> 02:04:02.012
I found out about you
only last year.


02:04:05.955 --> 02:04:06.922
But...


02:04:08.624 --> 02:04:11.252
youve always known about me.


02:04:13.095 --> 02:04:15.757
Did you never want to see me?


02:04:17.900 --> 02:04:19.800
I thought it was better this way.


02:04:27.776 --> 02:04:30.267
You asked for the truth.


02:04:31.680 --> 02:04:32.806
Well, this is it.


02:04:35.551 --> 02:04:36.916
I... am sorry, Imran.


02:04:38.854 --> 02:04:39.878
No, youre not.


02:04:44.793 --> 02:04:47.193
Is there something
I can do for you?


02:04:48.764 --> 02:04:51.756
Apologise only when it comes from here.


02:05:15.024 --> 02:05:17.993
<i>When clouds of pain loom in the sky.</i>


02:05:18.694 --> 02:05:21.663
<i>When a shadow of sadness flickers by.</i>


02:05:22.464 --> 02:05:25.433
<i>When a tear flnds it's way to the eye.</i>


02:05:25.801 --> 02:05:28.770
<i>When fear keeps the loneliness alive.</i>


02:05:29.772 --> 02:05:34.410
<i>I try and console my heart</i>
Why is it that you cry? I ask.


02:05:34.410 --> 02:05:36.935
<i>This is only what life imparts.</i>


02:05:37.680 --> 02:05:40.080
<i>These deep silences within.</i>


02:05:40.582 --> 02:05:43.210
<i>Have been handed out to all by time.</i>


02:05:44.453 --> 02:05:46.944
<i>Everyone's story has a little sorrow.</i>


02:05:47.523 --> 02:05:50.185
<i>Everyone's share has a little Sunshine.</i>


02:05:51.560 --> 02:05:53.619
<i>No need for water in your eyes.</i>


02:05:55.030 --> 02:05:57.328
<i>Every moment can be a new life.</i>


02:05:58.734 --> 02:06:00.929
<i>Why do you let them pass you by.</i>


02:06:02.404 --> 02:06:04.372
<i>Oh heart, why is it that you cry?</i>


02:06:13.615 --> 02:06:14.775
Morning...


02:06:21.023 --> 02:06:22.047
Did you sleep or not?


02:06:23.692 --> 02:06:24.420
No.


02:06:33.602 --> 02:06:36.230
I think, we should get going.


02:06:37.940 --> 02:06:38.929
Lets go.


02:06:40.376 --> 02:06:41.001
Arjun...


02:06:45.180 --> 02:06:47.011
Im really sorry.


02:07:11.907 --> 02:07:12.965
III see you at the car.


02:07:13.208 --> 02:07:14.038
Yeah.


02:07:18.180 --> 02:07:20.080
What do you mean,
you slept in the car?


02:07:20.849 --> 02:07:22.146
Long story, babe.


02:07:23.218 --> 02:07:24.242
Tell me, what happened?


02:07:25.521 --> 02:07:27.489
Well, Imran just...


02:07:29.425 --> 02:07:30.585
III tell you later, okay.


02:07:31.460 --> 02:07:33.189
Why? Tell me now,
what happened?


02:07:33.529 --> 02:07:36.498
I cant tell you right now.
III tell you when Im back.


02:07:36.865 --> 02:07:38.332
Why are you getting irritated?


02:07:38.600 --> 02:07:40.465
Why are you going on about it?


02:07:40.702 --> 02:07:41.999
Okay, forget it.


02:07:46.442 --> 02:07:47.374
See.


02:07:47.743 --> 02:07:49.370
Its our wedding card.
Can you see it?


02:07:49.778 --> 02:07:51.177
Isnt it gorgeous?


02:07:51.713 --> 02:07:53.340
Im just so happy with it.


02:07:54.183 --> 02:07:56.785
Oh... Ive emailed a few options
for your suit.


02:07:56.785 --> 02:07:59.481
Please select one. Okay?
Dont forget.


02:07:59.955 --> 02:08:00.853
Okay.


02:08:03.092 --> 02:08:05.287
You are so far away.


02:08:06.595 --> 02:08:08.062
You love me, right?


02:08:09.431 --> 02:08:10.398
Yeah.


02:08:11.100 --> 02:08:12.965
Then stop fighting with me.


02:08:13.802 --> 02:08:16.930
Everything was fine before you
went on this holiday.


02:08:17.606 --> 02:08:19.403
Kabir, just come home.


02:08:19.908 --> 02:08:23.344
To me, your family, your friends.


02:08:23.745 --> 02:08:25.542
My friends are with me.


02:08:25.848 --> 02:08:27.816
Yeah, I know.
But you know what I mean.


02:08:39.394 --> 02:08:46.300
Happy birthday to you...


02:08:47.269 --> 02:08:50.898
Happy birthday dear Anjali...


02:08:51.573 --> 02:08:54.098
Happy birthday to you...


02:09:00.749 --> 02:09:01.647
Oh my God!


02:09:02.684 --> 02:09:03.878
Its beautiful!


02:09:04.253 --> 02:09:05.311
- Nice, right?
- Yes!


02:09:07.422 --> 02:09:08.286
Tanya?


02:09:18.433 --> 02:09:19.593
What are you doing, baby?


02:09:20.202 --> 02:09:21.601
Im sorry, Im so happy.


02:09:22.070 --> 02:09:24.300
Kabir just proposed to Natasha.


02:09:24.373 --> 02:09:25.606
What??


02:09:25.607 --> 02:09:27.608
Oh my God!


02:09:27.609 --> 02:09:30.279
You couldve waited until
your mother had cut the cake.


02:09:30.279 --> 02:09:33.271
Kabir, this is the best
birthday gift, ever!


02:09:33.348 --> 02:09:34.449
I love you, son.


02:09:34.450 --> 02:09:35.507
The shy guy!


02:09:36.185 --> 02:09:38.287
Its a double celebration.


02:09:38.287 --> 02:09:39.754
Im so happy.


02:09:40.522 --> 02:09:41.511
Now you have to call me mummy.


02:09:43.025 --> 02:09:44.890
Get some champagne!


02:09:47.596 --> 02:09:48.596
Come here.


02:09:50.599 --> 02:09:51.998
Very good decision.


02:09:54.236 --> 02:09:56.204
Im so happy.


02:09:57.472 --> 02:09:59.997
Babe, what just happened in there?


02:10:00.075 --> 02:10:02.373
- What do you mean?
- I mean...


02:10:02.878 --> 02:10:04.613
This ring...


02:10:04.613 --> 02:10:06.012
I got it for my mom.


02:10:08.016 --> 02:10:09.813
Its her birthday gift.


02:10:10.419 --> 02:10:11.477
This is for your mom?


02:10:12.120 --> 02:10:14.987
Look at it sweety...
its a mummy ring.


02:10:15.057 --> 02:10:16.458
What?


02:10:16.458 --> 02:10:17.823
Why didn't you say something?


02:10:18.293 --> 02:10:19.817
I tried.


02:10:19.895 --> 02:10:23.797
But you were excited and screaming.
And Tanya made an announcement.


02:10:24.466 --> 02:10:26.627
So you don't want to marry me?


02:10:27.069 --> 02:10:30.596
Its not about you.
I havent even thought about marriage.


02:10:33.275 --> 02:10:35.072
What do I tell my father?


02:10:40.048 --> 02:10:42.951
Well say that
we gave it some more thought and...


02:10:42.951 --> 02:10:45.351
we need more time. Thats all.


02:10:45.420 --> 02:10:47.047
This is so embarrassing.


02:10:47.889 --> 02:10:49.948
Im so sorry, sweety.


02:10:50.892 --> 02:10:53.588
You don't ever want to marry me?


02:10:54.863 --> 02:10:56.698
Its not like that.


02:10:56.698 --> 02:10:59.223
If it is, you better tell me right now!


02:11:00.535 --> 02:11:03.238
I really love you, Kabir.
And I don't...


02:11:03.238 --> 02:11:06.469
No, no... no sweety. Dont cry.


02:11:06.541 --> 02:11:07.473
Not now.


02:11:14.850 --> 02:11:15.578
Kabir...


02:11:17.519 --> 02:11:21.216
are you even serious
about this relationship or not?


02:11:24.559 --> 02:11:25.389
You know what...


02:11:36.438 --> 02:11:37.462
Will you marry me?


02:12:01.596 --> 02:12:02.654
Who is it?


02:12:17.546 --> 02:12:18.410
Room service.


02:12:19.614 --> 02:12:20.239
Laila?


02:12:21.283 --> 02:12:22.307
Hi!


02:12:22.384 --> 02:12:23.214
Oh my God!


02:12:24.619 --> 02:12:26.086
Youre here... how... I mean...


02:12:26.521 --> 02:12:29.217
Imran called and
he begged me to come.


02:12:29.558 --> 02:12:30.752
- So I came.
- Imran?


02:12:31.226 --> 02:12:32.250
I knew it.


02:12:32.928 --> 02:12:34.486
He is my best friend.


02:12:37.632 --> 02:12:39.793
I am... so glad youre here.


02:12:41.236 --> 02:12:42.897
Im glad you are glad.


02:12:45.574 --> 02:12:47.735
Hello... my <i>the</i> two <i>the</i> love <i>the</i> birds!


02:12:48.210 --> 02:12:49.541
Hello!


02:12:49.678 --> 02:12:50.736
Surprised, Arjun?


02:12:52.047 --> 02:12:53.105
Thank you.


02:12:53.181 --> 02:12:54.583
Its good to see you.


02:12:54.583 --> 02:12:55.777
- And you.
- Hey gorgeous.


02:12:55.851 --> 02:12:57.919
- I love you too.
- Nice to have you back.


02:12:57.919 --> 02:12:59.284
You got a tan!


02:13:00.055 --> 02:13:01.054
Get dressed, soon!


02:13:01.055 --> 02:13:02.389
- We had to leave at seven.
- Correct.


02:13:02.390 --> 02:13:03.592
- Two minutes?
- You missed me?


02:13:03.593 --> 02:13:05.260
I always miss you, darling.


02:13:05.260 --> 02:13:06.284
Where are we going?


02:13:06.361 --> 02:13:07.988
Its a surprise.
Cant tell you in front of him.


02:13:26.047 --> 02:13:27.207
Whats going on?


02:13:27.616 --> 02:13:28.674
What do you mean?


02:13:28.917 --> 02:13:29.975
Its San Fermin.


02:13:30.051 --> 02:13:31.084
Running with the bulls.


02:13:31.085 --> 02:13:32.485
- Really?
- Didnt you know?


02:13:32.554 --> 02:13:33.680
Just follow me...


02:13:41.963 --> 02:13:43.021
Holy shit!


02:13:50.071 --> 02:13:51.698
Are these guys mad?
What are they doing?


02:13:51.940 --> 02:13:52.736
Suicide.


02:13:53.275 --> 02:13:54.640
Isnt that why you are here?


02:14:05.353 --> 02:14:07.412
I felt this should be the
last experience of our trip.


02:14:08.123 --> 02:14:10.591
This could be the
<i>last</i> experience of our life!


02:14:10.926 --> 02:14:13.094
Stop it, Arjun.
Lets grab a bite.


02:14:13.094 --> 02:14:13.651
Come on.


02:14:14.729 --> 02:14:15.797
- Excuse me.
- Dude are you...


02:14:15.798 --> 02:14:17.025
Im starving!


02:14:18.633 --> 02:14:20.123
This is not an adventure sport.


02:14:20.802 --> 02:14:22.099
I object, Judge <i>sahab</i>!


02:14:22.737 --> 02:14:24.905
I agree its not as safe as regular sports.


02:14:24.906 --> 02:14:26.475
And is illegal in some countries.


02:14:26.475 --> 02:14:29.273
But according to the
Spanish tradition and culture...


02:14:29.344 --> 02:14:30.276
it is allowed.


02:14:30.277 --> 02:14:32.269
And technically,
according to our deal...


02:14:32.347 --> 02:14:34.747
we can choose any sport, remember?


02:14:35.083 --> 02:14:36.585
Imran, its really dangerous, you know.


02:14:36.586 --> 02:14:38.780
Yes, those bulls could kill us, alright?


02:14:39.020 --> 02:14:41.690
Well be dangling on their horns
like tandoori chicken on skewers!


02:14:41.690 --> 02:14:43.419
Precisely the point.


02:14:44.559 --> 02:14:46.618
You want to get rid of
the fear within you?


02:14:46.895 --> 02:14:49.056
Well then, heres
our deepest fear. Death.


02:14:50.098 --> 02:14:51.122
Lets face it.


02:14:51.733 --> 02:14:53.099
Because beyond this fear...


02:14:53.100 --> 02:14:53.999
lies victory!


02:14:54.069 --> 02:14:56.094
Please spare us the tag lines!


02:14:56.538 --> 02:14:58.233
Dude, think about it!


02:14:58.473 --> 02:15:02.102
No training, no instructors.
Just us, my amigos!


02:15:02.844 --> 02:15:04.641
And some bulls running after us.


02:15:04.880 --> 02:15:07.178
If you want to live... just run!


02:15:07.582 --> 02:15:09.743
Laila, do you know
any psychiatrist around here?


02:15:10.519 --> 02:15:12.749
Because our amigo has
completely lost it!


02:15:13.588 --> 02:15:15.613
III be at the starting line
at seven tomorrow morning.


02:15:16.258 --> 02:15:18.226
With or without you.


02:15:23.765 --> 02:15:24.163
I have something for you, Imran.


02:15:24.164 --> 02:15:25.154
I have something for you, Imran.


02:15:26.034 --> 02:15:26.864
Its from Nuria.


02:15:30.639 --> 02:15:31.435
Its in Spanish.


02:15:32.407 --> 02:15:33.669
Love has no language.


02:15:34.276 --> 02:15:34.970
So true.


02:15:38.013 --> 02:15:39.344
I think you should
buy her something.


02:15:40.181 --> 02:15:41.011
Youre absolutely right.


02:15:41.583 --> 02:15:43.141
Guys... next stop - shopping.


02:15:44.586 --> 02:15:46.144
Count me out,
Im going back to the hotel.


02:15:47.222 --> 02:15:48.348
Are you alright?


02:15:50.725 --> 02:15:51.555
Im fine.


02:15:52.427 --> 02:15:54.395
That well only know after a test.


02:15:55.263 --> 02:15:56.059
Test?


02:15:57.299 --> 02:15:58.527
What do you say, Dr. <i>Fraud?</i>.


02:15:59.434 --> 02:16:00.128
Are you game?


02:16:00.735 --> 02:16:01.463
Bring it on.


02:16:02.137 --> 02:16:03.331
You have to say the first thing...


02:16:03.405 --> 02:16:05.373
I know the drill. Ask!


02:16:06.274 --> 02:16:07.002
Black.


02:16:07.242 --> 02:16:07.799
Night.


02:16:07.876 --> 02:16:08.740
Sea.


02:16:08.910 --> 02:16:09.638
Salty.


02:16:09.711 --> 02:16:10.544
Work.


02:16:10.545 --> 02:16:11.546
Money.


02:16:11.546 --> 02:16:12.410
Sex.


02:16:12.614 --> 02:16:13.448
I like!


02:16:13.448 --> 02:16:13.971
Friend.


02:16:14.349 --> 02:16:15.077
You.


02:16:15.283 --> 02:16:16.250
Marriage.


02:16:17.586 --> 02:16:18.746
Family.


02:16:25.594 --> 02:16:26.424
What?


02:16:28.229 --> 02:16:29.731
Is that all?


02:16:29.731 --> 02:16:31.028
It was enough.


02:16:32.901 --> 02:16:34.569
Smartass...


02:16:34.569 --> 02:16:38.266
Youre using my trick on me?
Just say what you want to.


02:16:38.807 --> 02:16:39.705
Okay.


02:16:40.442 --> 02:16:42.842
You hesitated on marriage.


02:16:43.278 --> 02:16:44.677
So?


02:16:44.746 --> 02:16:48.204
Im just saying...
you hesitated... on marriage.


02:16:52.187 --> 02:16:53.051
Look...


02:16:54.055 --> 02:16:57.582
I don't have the time for this crap.
See you later.


02:17:01.363 --> 02:17:03.991
- Okay.
- Im sorry, Im going to...


02:17:11.906 --> 02:17:12.873
Kabir.


02:17:18.013 --> 02:17:18.809
Go!


02:17:21.716 --> 02:17:22.842
Kabir!


02:17:23.852 --> 02:17:25.319
Kabir... man, just stop!


02:17:26.021 --> 02:17:27.147
What?


02:17:28.256 --> 02:17:30.121
Talk to us man. Whats going on?


02:17:30.525 --> 02:17:32.390
Its nothing, really.


02:17:34.362 --> 02:17:35.329
Kabir...


02:17:37.298 --> 02:17:39.596
Look, Im sorry I lost my cool.


02:17:40.902 --> 02:17:43.234
Because I said you have
a problem with marriage?


02:17:44.105 --> 02:17:47.370
I guess, Im freaking out.
I don't know whats happening.


02:17:47.776 --> 02:17:50.110
Its normal to be nervous.


02:17:50.111 --> 02:17:52.614
Its not like youre having
an arranged marriage.


02:17:52.614 --> 02:17:55.276
Yeah, but she isnt
the same person I met.


02:17:55.950 --> 02:17:58.111
Shes changed,
shes become possessive.


02:17:58.720 --> 02:18:02.019
The girl I knew was a
talented, independent interior designer.


02:18:02.190 --> 02:18:04.225
She enjoyed her work.


02:18:04.225 --> 02:18:05.192
But now...


02:18:05.760 --> 02:18:07.728
shes bid adieu to her passion and...


02:18:07.962 --> 02:18:09.862
taken over my life.


02:18:10.799 --> 02:18:12.801
Of course, I want a partner but...


02:18:12.801 --> 02:18:14.496
I want my own life too!


02:18:14.803 --> 02:18:18.603
The whole <i>two bodies, one soul</i> thing
I wont be able to handle it.


02:18:29.284 --> 02:18:31.275
- May I ask you something?
- Yes.


02:18:32.587 --> 02:18:34.817
Dont you think
you proposed to her too soon?


02:18:35.557 --> 02:18:37.725
Actually, I didn't even propose.


02:18:37.726 --> 02:18:39.294
What?


02:18:39.294 --> 02:18:41.626
Id bought a ring for my mom
as a birthday gift.


02:18:41.896 --> 02:18:45.297
Before giving it, I happened to show
it to Natasha and she thought...


02:18:45.734 --> 02:18:47.201
it was meant for her.


02:18:48.970 --> 02:18:50.665
- Are you crazy?
- What are you doing?


02:18:51.139 --> 02:18:52.936
- Whats wrong with him?
- What's wrong with him?


02:18:58.246 --> 02:19:00.612
No wonder this vacation was
so important for you.


02:19:01.349 --> 02:19:02.008
Meaning?


02:19:03.118 --> 02:19:06.349
Basically, you wanted to hear from someone
else that you shouldn't get married.


02:19:06.554 --> 02:19:09.256
And besides us,
who wouldve told you this.


02:19:09.257 --> 02:19:11.126
Have you totally lost it?


02:19:11.126 --> 02:19:13.788
The invites are printed.
This isnt the time to overreact!


02:19:14.763 --> 02:19:15.730
Kabir.


02:19:17.265 --> 02:19:18.926
We know Natasha is a great girl.


02:19:19.200 --> 02:19:21.168
And we know you like her.


02:19:21.703 --> 02:19:23.193
And of course,
you don't want to hurt her.


02:19:24.239 --> 02:19:27.208
But ask yourself...
Do you really want to marry her?


02:19:27.942 --> 02:19:29.603
And if not, be honest.


02:19:29.677 --> 02:19:31.167
To yourself and to her.


02:19:31.880 --> 02:19:34.781
Of course, shell be hurt.
But in the long run its best for both of you.


02:19:34.949 --> 02:19:36.576
He is absolutely right, Kabir.


02:19:36.851 --> 02:19:38.648
But Ive made a commitment.


02:19:39.020 --> 02:19:40.755
Okay, you screwed up.


02:19:40.755 --> 02:19:42.780
No ones going to send you to prison.


02:19:42.857 --> 02:19:45.417
Its not that simple.
Our parents are involved.


02:19:45.627 --> 02:19:46.457
Parents?


02:19:46.895 --> 02:19:48.021
Dude, its your life.


02:19:51.099 --> 02:19:52.430
You wont get it.


02:19:53.601 --> 02:19:54.431
Just...


02:19:55.103 --> 02:19:57.264
Just let it be, okay? Im sorry.


02:19:58.106 --> 02:19:59.232
Kabir...


02:20:03.011 --> 02:20:03.978
What a guy!


02:20:22.230 --> 02:20:23.254
Laila?


02:20:27.202 --> 02:20:28.226
Why're you shouting?


02:20:29.304 --> 02:20:30.931
Why are you so far?


02:20:45.220 --> 02:20:46.118
Better?


02:20:47.455 --> 02:20:48.285
Best.


02:20:51.359 --> 02:20:52.087
Ammi?


02:20:53.228 --> 02:20:54.695
How are you?


02:20:57.599 --> 02:20:59.567
I met Salman.


02:21:05.940 --> 02:21:08.966
I now know why you and Abu
kept this from me.


02:21:12.580 --> 02:21:13.638
Im sorry, Ammi.


02:21:16.584 --> 02:21:17.642
I love you.


02:21:19.420 --> 02:21:20.944
I love you too, my boy.


02:21:57.258 --> 02:22:00.716
<i>It took a while but.</i>


02:22:05.633 --> 02:22:10.036
<i>I've now learnt to live.</i>


02:22:14.509 --> 02:22:18.206
<i>Without the consolation of tears.</i>


02:22:22.884 --> 02:22:27.548
<i>I've now learnt to live.</i>


02:22:47.442 --> 02:22:54.115
<i>There is someone who brought to mind.</i>


02:22:54.115 --> 02:22:58.677
<i>How I had gotten left behind.</i>


02:23:00.421 --> 02:23:06.087
<i>Life is like a caravan.</i>


02:23:07.228 --> 02:23:11.187
<i>Why are you lonely, my man.</i>


02:23:13.601 --> 02:23:18.061
<i>Just know that we are all here.</i>


02:23:41.262 --> 02:23:44.322
The first rocket indicates that
the pen gates have been opened.


02:23:44.732 --> 02:23:47.200
Second rocket indicates that
the bulls are coming towards us.


02:23:47.535 --> 02:23:49.237
We run at the second rocket.


02:23:49.237 --> 02:23:50.101
Second rocket.


02:23:51.739 --> 02:23:53.297
Oh San Fermin, please protect us.


02:23:55.243 --> 02:23:56.574
If I die...


02:23:56.944 --> 02:23:58.673
my spirit will come back to haunt you.


02:23:59.113 --> 02:24:00.637
Why are you thinking about death?


02:24:00.715 --> 02:24:02.683
Think about what youll do
if you survive.


02:24:07.255 --> 02:24:08.255
Listen...


02:24:08.423 --> 02:24:09.321
a new pact.


02:24:10.191 --> 02:24:11.886
An if-I-get out-alive pact.


02:24:13.061 --> 02:24:15.621
If I get out alive,
III let you read my poetry.


02:24:16.798 --> 02:24:18.299
Why just you? III just...


02:24:18.299 --> 02:24:19.493
get it published.


02:24:20.368 --> 02:24:21.335
You write poetry?


02:24:21.569 --> 02:24:22.399
Yes.


02:24:24.205 --> 02:24:25.172
Okay.


02:24:25.473 --> 02:24:27.304
If I get out alive...


02:24:30.378 --> 02:24:31.072
Okay!


02:24:31.546 --> 02:24:33.380
If I get out alive...


02:24:33.381 --> 02:24:35.416
III go to Morocco with Laila.


02:24:35.416 --> 02:24:36.246
Yeah!


02:24:36.584 --> 02:24:37.608
Thats what III do.


02:24:38.019 --> 02:24:40.186
Whats the worst that could happen?
III get fired.


02:24:40.187 --> 02:24:41.189
- Right?
- Yeah.


02:24:41.190 --> 02:24:42.390
Who cares man?


02:24:42.390 --> 02:24:43.584
III be with her and I will live.


02:24:43.958 --> 02:24:45.118
Well done, my bro!


02:24:46.127 --> 02:24:46.957
Come on, Kabir.


02:24:49.363 --> 02:24:50.031
Okay.


02:24:50.032 --> 02:24:51.726
If I get out alive...


02:24:55.870 --> 02:24:57.428
Shit guys! The gates are open!


02:24:57.772 --> 02:24:58.830
Kabir just say it.


02:24:58.906 --> 02:25:00.601
Its okay, just say it.


02:25:07.882 --> 02:25:10.718
If I get out alive,
III go to London...


02:25:10.718 --> 02:25:12.447
and tell Natasha that...


02:25:22.263 --> 02:25:23.662
Say what? Just say it!


02:25:23.931 --> 02:25:25.159
Come on, Kabir!


02:25:29.137 --> 02:25:31.037
- Come on, Kabir!
- Come on!


02:25:31.105 --> 02:25:33.699
<i>I'm sorry but I can't marry you.</i>


02:25:35.910 --> 02:25:36.575
- Congratulations!
- Look out!


02:25:36.576 --> 02:25:37.805
- Congratulations!
- Look out!


02:28:20.374 --> 02:28:23.077
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your restlessness in your heart.


02:28:23.077 --> 02:28:25.136
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:25.212 --> 02:28:27.772
<i>If you're carrying</i>
the lightning of dreams in your eyes.


02:28:27.848 --> 02:28:29.042
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:30.351 --> 02:28:33.343
<i>Like a gust of wind</i>,
learn to live free.


02:28:34.021 --> 02:28:36.990
<i>Learn to flow like</i>
the waves that make a sea.


02:28:37.625 --> 02:28:40.753
<i>Let your arms be wide open</i>,
to every moment you meet.


02:28:41.462 --> 02:28:44.954
<i>May every moment gift you</i>
a new sight to greet.


02:28:45.566 --> 02:28:47.966
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your wonder in your eyes.


02:28:48.035 --> 02:28:49.900
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:50.604 --> 02:28:53.698
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your restlessness in your heart.


02:28:54.709 --> 02:28:55.835
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:29:06.253 --> 02:29:06.287
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:06.288 --> 02:29:10.124
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:10.124 --> 02:29:13.855
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:13.928 --> 02:29:17.830
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:17.898 --> 02:29:21.561
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:21.702 --> 02:29:25.539
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:25.539 --> 02:29:28.906
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:37.718 --> 02:29:42.087
<i>Just when the heart</i>
started moving to another beat.


02:29:45.393 --> 02:29:49.853
<i>Out of nowhere</i>
a new thought found its feet.


02:29:52.933 --> 02:29:56.770
<i>That life gives you just one shot.</i>


02:29:56.771 --> 02:30:00.441
<i>So why not love it with all you've got.</i>


02:30:00.441 --> 02:30:04.309
<i>Who knows what we're waiting for</i>


02:30:04.378 --> 02:30:08.610
<i>'Cause life is here and life is now.</i>


02:30:12.286 --> 02:30:17.314
<i>What was only a desire till yesterday.</i>


02:30:20.060 --> 02:30:24.360
<i>Is exactly what we've found today.</i>


02:30:27.435 --> 02:30:30.427
<i>Hand in hand let's always be.</i>


02:30:31.272 --> 02:30:34.400
<i>As we wander through our destiny.</i>


02:30:35.009 --> 02:30:38.679
<i>And all day and all night.</i>


02:30:38.679 --> 02:30:43.707
<i>Happiness rains down on</i>
everything in sight.


02:30:45.920 --> 02:30:49.957
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:30:49.957 --> 02:30:53.688
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:30:53.761 --> 02:30:57.598
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:30:57.598 --> 02:31:01.762
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:31:17.685 --> 02:31:20.518
<i>If it can knit a new dream everyday.</i>


02:31:21.522 --> 02:31:24.389
<i>Then you can call it a life.</i>


02:31:25.292 --> 02:31:28.125
<i>If it can lead you down a brand new way.</i>


02:31:29.196 --> 02:31:31.994
<i>Then you can call it a life.</i>


02:31:32.733 --> 02:31:35.634
<i>If it can flirt and fly</i>,
If it can spin and jive.


02:31:35.703 --> 02:31:43.170
<i>Then you can call it a life</i>

